SUMMARY:Student Government Meeting
DESCRIPTION:The Fairmont State University Student Government Association (SGA) holds regular meetings to discuss campus initiatives\, student concerns\, and upcoming events that impact the university community. These meetings provide a platform for student leaders to collaborate\, advocate for their peers\, and work alongside faculty\, staff\, and administrators to enhance the student experience.
LOCATION:Hardway Hall Room 128\, 1201 Locust Ave\, Fairmont\, WV
URL:https://static.campuslabsengage.com/discovery/images/events/groupbusiness.jpg
STATUS:CANCELLED
