DTSTART:20250307T170000Z
DTEND:20250307T210000Z
SUMMARY:Liquid Nitrogen Ice Cream
DESCRIPTION:The process is simple: we put cream in a bowl\, add the ingredients\, and the blast it with liquid nitrogen. Beautiful clouds of vapor billow from the bowl\, roll across the table and cascade over the edge. The liquid nitrogen freezes it so fast that the ice crystals dont get a chance to grow and the resulting ice cream is the smoothest\, creamiest and freshest youll ever experience. It is amazing to watch and tastes incredible. Private Island Ice Cream isnt just ice cream\, its ice cream with a show!
LOCATION:Falcon Center Main Street\, 1201 Locust Ave\, Fairmont\, WV
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/7e32aff7-5743-44e5-b3b1-500440567158cbfaf7dd-3790-4ba2-abe8-117d28b47970.png
END:VEVENT
