UID:11205849@fairmontstate.edu
DTSTAMP:20260803T173205Z
DTSTART:20250327T160000Z
DTEND:20250327T200000Z
SUMMARY:Joe's Spray Can Art
DESCRIPTION:An artist (Or multiple) will set up and put on a show of the unique art style called Spray Can Art. They will produce 57 paintings at the rate of one painting every 3 to 5 minutes. Done on poster board with a spray can\, the artist uses a strange array of tools to manipulate the paint. Its a show in itself! Joe is an accomplished New York City street artist who was struck by lightning while standing on his apartment roof. He taught himself to paint while recovering\, and when he conquered the streets of NYC\, he moved to Florida where he teamed up with three other artists who each have their own unique artistic style. Joe and his trained artists are awesome to work with\, they put on a great show\, and at the end your students have a lifetime memento.
LOCATION:Falcon Center Quad\, 1201 Locust Ave\, Fairmont\, We
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/2be87c72-a0ac-450c-b257-8a2e7097564c16ee932b-6246-40f3-9337-c1780d9e9396.png
END:VEVENT
