SUMMARY:Falcon Focus:  Student Organization Registration 
DESCRIPTION:Are you a student leader or advisor looking to better manage your organization? Join us for an informational session on using Engage\, Fairmont States official student organization management platform! Bring your lunch and join us! In this session\, youll learn how to: Register and re-register your student org Create and promote events Track attendance and engagement Manage rosters and officer roles Access important forms and documents Maximize visibility and involvement Whether you're new to Engage or want to sharpen your skills\, this session will provide step-by-step guidance\, live demonstrations\, and time for Q&A. Who should attend: Current student org officers New student leaders Advisors Anyone interested in getting involved!
LOCATION:Ruth Ann Musick Library Room MMB\, 1201 Locust Ave\, Fairmont\, WV
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/97321f61-a40d-409b-a1ed-1c4c90d6b4f3a8833733-adf0-448a-8360-e72c316766fb.png
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:11341000@fairmontstate.edu
DTSTAMP:20260803T173205Z
DTSTART:20250909T163000Z
DTEND:20250909T173000Z
SUMMARY:Falcon Focus: Managing Co-Curricular Pathways
DESCRIPTION:Join us to learn how to manage co-curricular Pathways to enhance your experience at Fairmont State! Attend a session and take control of your college journey today! Students who attend all sessions will receive a certificate of completion!
LOCATION:Ruth Ann Musick Library Room MMB\, 1201 Locust Ave\, Fairmont\, WV
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/051516f4-a560-46bd-b979-516d4ac811cabbc02f7f-39cf-4298-9bc9-6bdc4fcd584d.png
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:11341008@fairmontstate.edu
DTSTAMP:20260803T173205Z
DTSTART:20250930T163000Z
DTEND:20250930T173000Z
SUMMARY:Falcon Focus: What Is an Involvement Transcript?
DESCRIPTION:Did you know your campus involvement can be officially documented and recognized? Join this info session to learn all about the Involvement Transcript in Engage\, Fairmont States student engagement platform. Your Involvement Transcript is more than a listit's a powerful tool that tracks your participation in student organizations\, leadership roles\, events\, service hours\, and co-curricular activities. Its perfect for: Resumes and job applications Graduate school applications Scholarship interviews Reflecting on your growth and leadership journey In this session\, well cover: Whats included on your Involvement Transcript How to access and update your transcript in Engage How to make sure your activities are being recorded Tips for using your transcript as part of your professional portfolio Who Should Attend: Any student involved in campus life Student leaders and organization members Students applying for jobs\, internships\, or grad school Attend a session and take control of your college journey today! Students who attend all sessions will receive a certificate of completion!
LOCATION:Turley 106
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/dd8d6132-f969-4899-aead-1421fc5f1e110a944f08-f548-4477-a149-624da5d1d342.png
STATUS:CANCELLED
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:11341015@fairmontstate.edu
DTSTAMP:20260803T173205Z
DTSTART:20251014T163000Z
DTEND:20251014T173000Z
SUMMARY:Falcon Focus: Experience and Service Requests 
DESCRIPTION:Have you participated in a volunteer project\, leadership activity\, internship\, or campus event you want recognized on your Involvement Transcript? Learn how to properly submit Experience and Service Requests in Engage\, Fairmont States student engagement platform! This session will walk you through the simple steps to: Submit a new Experience or Service Request Log hours and describe your involvement Connect your experiences to co-curricular pathways Ensure your efforts show up on your official Involvement Transcript Get your experiences approved quickly and correctly Whether you're logging community service\, leadership roles\, or other out-of-class experiences\, this session will help you get the recognition you deserve. Who Should Attend: Students involved in service or volunteer work Organization members and leaders Students building their Involvement Transcript Anyone looking to document their experiences for future opportunities Attend a session and take control of your college journey today! Students who attend all sessions will receive a certificate of completion!
LOCATION:Library MMA
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/a16a87b4-70e6-4e14-afed-45e815c076a255df7a04-de21-48a3-a967-2932e0eadd75.png
