SUMMARY:Echosmith: Fall Concert 2025 
DESCRIPTION:Echosmith is coming to Fairmont State!Join us Friday\, Sept. 19\, at 7 PM on the Falcon Center Quad for our Fall Concert featuring the multi-platinum alt-pop trio behind hits like Cool Kids and Bright.Free & open to the publicVIP Meet & Greet before the concertCash concessions + 21+ barDont miss an unforgettable night of music\, community\, and fun!Rain location will be Falcon Center Gym 1.
