SUMMARY:Trivia & the Constitution: We the Know-It-Alls
DESCRIPTION:Test your knowledge of U.S. history\, government\, and the Constitution ata fun and fast-paced trivia night celebrating Constitution Week at Fairmont State! Gather your friends and compete in teams for prizes\, bragging rights\, and the title of campus constitutional champion. Questions will cover everything from the Founding Fathers and landmark Supreme Court cases to surprising facts about American democracy. Whether you're a political science pro or just love a good challenge\, this event is a great way to engage with civic history in a relaxed\, student-friendly setting.
LOCATION:Private Dining Room-Falcon Center\, Private Dining Room-Falcon Center
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/7a39ec83-2ba1-432c-adfc-35d02ee19a8fc0b0c1db-819f-41ad-b81e-0ba513400842.png
