SUMMARY:Job Fair: Join Our Campus Team!
DESCRIPTION:Description:Looking for a flexible\, on-campus job that keeps you connected and builds real-world skills? Join us at the Fairmont State Job Fair and explore exciting opportunities to work in key campus operations! Meet our hiring managers\, interview on the spot\, and apply immediatelywalk away with a job offer the same day! Were hiring for the following positions: Spirit Store Associate Bring Falcon pride to life by assisting customers\, stocking merchandise\, and supporting in-store promotions. Print Shop Associate Gain hands-on experience with print production and client services while keeping campus materials on brand. Conference & Event Staff Help make campus events successful through setup\, guest support\, and customer service. Engage Fairmont State Technician Support our student engagement platform by assisting with event postings\, training\, and data management. Why Attend? On-campus jobs with flexible scheduling Build professional experience Network with campus staff and peers On-the-spot interviews and hiring opportunities Dont miss your chance to join our team and make an impact at Fairmont State!
LOCATION:Falcon Center Conference Rooms\, 1201 Locust Avenue\, Fairmont\, WEST VIRGINIA
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/5926db0f-8c14-4cba-a3f2-a4e373900c67cbdebd6d-d026-4a42-adda-d4d9657e30b5.png
END:VEVENT
