DTSTART:20250918T163000Z
DTEND:20250918T173000Z
SUMMARY:Success Academic - Study Skills and Time Management
DESCRIPTION:Managing time effectively in college is crucial for academic success and personal well-being. Balancing coursework\, extracurricular activities\, and personal responsibilities can be challenging\, but with the right strategies\, students can stay on top of their commitments and reduce stress.
LOCATION:Turley 215\, 1201 Locust Ave Turley Center\, Fairmont\, WV
