SUMMARY:Wartz 'n All Dulcimer Jam 
DESCRIPTION:This is an unstructured\, casual event for lap dulcimer players to learn\, swap songs\, and play music together. Other acoustic instruments are welcome\, too! This is for all ages and abilities\, and we will have several cardboard dulcimers to use. This event is free and open to all.Jammersusually take a break at noon for lunch\, then resume playing at 1pm.
