SUMMARY:Democracy Starts Here: Constitution Week Opening
DESCRIPTION:Join us as we launch Constitution Week at Fairmont State with a special Opening Day Ceremony celebrating the foundational principles of our democracy. The event will begin with the Vice President of the Student Government Association reading the Preamble to the United States Constitution\, setting the tone for a week of civic reflection and engagement. We are honored to welcome both the Mayor of Fairmont and the President of Fairmont State University\, who will offer remarks on the importance of civic participation\, community leadership\, and the enduring relevance of the Constitution in our daily lives. This kickoff event marks the beginning of a week filled with thought-provoking programming\, conversation\, and celebration of our shared civic values.
LOCATION:Falcon Center Quad\, Falcon Center Quad
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/e85ec481-be1b-4c77-b0cd-cc00e1c2735a76334b37-70ca-48c7-b45b-8be9b1b57f1e.png
END:VEVENT
