SUMMARY:Gerrymandering - The Continuing Saga with Dr. Ken Martis" 
DESCRIPTION:This talk explores the geographic foundations of American politics with renowned political geographer Dr. Ken Martis. Drawing from his influential work mapping congressional districts and electoral trends\, Dr. Martis examines how geography shapes political representation\, voting patterns\, and the evolution of U.S. political boundaries. The session offers historical insights and visual analysis to better understand the spatial dimensions of American democracy.
LOCATION:Falcon Center 301\, Falcon Center 301
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/93e1e199-0554-4ca5-928a-c942e3d99ee4866aac83-e5bf-4e7e-86ec-d1c19354aa84.png
