SUMMARY:Engage Training with Resident Assistants 
DESCRIPTION:Engage Training is a dynamic and interactive professional development session designed to equip Fairmont State Universitys Resident Assistants (RAs) with the tools\, strategies\, and confidence to foster meaningful connections within their residential communities. This training focuses on developing essential leadership skills\, enhancing communication techniques\, promoting inclusive practices\, and empowering RAs to create a positive and engaging living environment.
