SUMMARY:Lunch and Learn | Behind the Scenes of Enrollment: Who We Are & What We Do
DESCRIPTION:Presenter: Alicia Kalka and Jason McCoy Join us for an engaging lunch and Learn as we pull back the curtain on the Enrollment Management Division at Fairmont State. We'll introduce you to the teams behind admissions and recruitment\, enrollment services\, student accounts\, financial aid\, orientation\, and student successand share how each plays a role in guiding students from inquiry to graduation. Learn how we use data\, strategy\, and personalized outreach to meet enrollment goals and support student success. This session will also highlight how campus partnerships are essential in shaping the student experience. Whether you're new to campus or looking to better understand our work\, we invite you to learn more and ask questions.
