SUMMARY:Are we in a Constitutional Crisis? Faculty Panel
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a thought-provoking lunchtime faculty panel exploring the concept of constitutional crisis in the United States. Faculty experts will examine historical and contemporary moments where the Constitutions limits have been tested\, discussing separation of powers\, rule of law\, and threats to democratic norms. Led by history professor J Tomlin.Lunch provided.
