SUMMARY:Lunch and Learn | What I Learned From The Great Teacher Seminar
DESCRIPTION:Presenter: James Long This summer I attended the 33rd annual great teacher seminar. The conference is dedicated to exploring good teaching independent of academic discipline and has attendees from all over the state (from WVU to community colleges). In this talk\, I'll go over what I learned while at the conference and why you should go to the next one!
