SUMMARY:Lunch and Learn | Say It Better: How Debate Skills Can Improve Classroom Discussions and Student Advocacy
DESCRIPTION:Presented by: Samantha Godbey This interactive session explores how techniques from debate can help students express themselves more clearly\, listen more deeply\, and argue more constructivelyboth in and out of the classroom. Whether you're moderating a class discussion\, advising a student club\, or mentoring a peer leader\, debate tools can help you guide students toward more confident\, reasoned\, and respectful communication.
