DESCRIPTION:Presented by: Derek Nuzum Your campus library is evolving\, and its time to rethink what we can do for your department and our students. Our team is committed to a future of collaboration across campus. We invite you to define that future together. This fast-paced and informative session will give faculty a refresher on our dynamic services\, adaptable spaces\, and tailored resources focused on amplifying student success and supporting your work plus a sneak peek at exciting new resources and upcoming initiatives. Bring your questions and/or suggestions for ways we can support a great academic year.
