SUMMARY:Health Fair
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a campus-wide Health Fair\, an engaging and educational event focused on promoting healthy lifestyles and well-being for students\, faculty\, and staff. The fair will feature a variety of health-related booths\, interactive activities\, free health screenings\, fitness demos\, and wellness resources provided by local healthcare professionals\, community organizations\, and campus departments. Whether you're interested in nutrition\, mental health\, physical fitness\, or general wellness\, there's something for everyone. Stop by to connect with resources\, ask questions\, and take a proactive step toward a healthier you! Free giveaways\, educational opportunities\, and hands-on activities will be available throughout the event. Dont miss this opportunity to invest in your health and have fun while doing it!
