SUMMARY:NASA IV&V Digital Star Lab Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Enjoy a planetarium show with Education Outreach Specialist Josh Revels from the NASA IV&V Education Resource Center. Learn about constellations\, planets\, the moon\, and much more through this interactive educator kit certification workshop. Learn how to bring the Digital Star Lab back to your school or education program! Open to all FSU students and community. Registration required:2025-26 Educator Workshop/Webinar Registration
LOCATION:Falcon Center Gym 1
URL:https://static.campuslabsengage.com/discovery/images/events/learning.jpg
