SUMMARY:Allegro Dance Company - Performance Collaboration
DESCRIPTION:Join the Allegro Company to celebrate your Italian Heritage An opportunity forFairmont State students to performor assist in a live production showcasing Italian folk and contemporary dance with Allegro Dance Company. This cross-cultural performance will invite student participation in dance\, music\, staging\, or media. An immersive experience on stage with the dancers.
LOCATION:WV Italian Heritage Festival\, 340 W. Main Street\, Clarksburg\, WV
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/370329fc-57ee-4550-a877-f35870b56c48daacca30-6580-4519-9090-e1bcb5b64d6d.png
