SUMMARY:JC Penney' s Suit-Up Event
DESCRIPTION:Dress for Success and Save Big! Join us forJCPenneys Suit-Up Event\, hosted by Fairmont State University Career Development Center\, WVU Career Services\, and JCPenney Corporation. Date: Sunday\, September 7\, 2025 Location: Morgantown Mall\, Morgantown\, WV Time: 4:00 PM 6:00 PM Exclusive Offer for University Students: Up to 45% OFF professional attire for men and women\, including suits\, dress shirts\, shoes\, and accessories. Shop stylish options perfect for career fairs\, interviews\, internships\, and the workplace. Enjoy personalized style tips from JCPenney staff to help you look your best. Why Attend?Your appearance makes a lasting impression. This is your chance to refresh your wardrobe\, save money\, and prepare to step confidently into your next career opportunity. How to Participate: Bring your valid student ID. Stop by JCPenney at Morgantown Mall during event hours. Take advantage of exclusive discounts and giveaways! Look the Part. Land the Opportunity.Dont miss this one-day event to suit up for success!
LOCATION:JCPenney's Morgantown Mall\, 9560 Mall Road\, Morgantown\, WV
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/a73df1e8-e353-4d69-a19d-da76d82ffe9f46a45baa-0af8-4e0a-9ee2-1d47a54c3ce9.png
