SUMMARY:Good Thinking Workshop 
DESCRIPTION:We are pleased to invite you to a comprehensive group presentation featuring Dr. Melissa L. Mastorovich from STAT Nursing Consultants. During this session\, Dr. Mastorovich will share her extensive expertise in nursing practices\, offering valuable insights and engaging discussions on relevant topics in the field. This is a unique opportunity to learn from a seasoned professional and enhance your understanding of current nursing trends and best practices. Students will also receive a copy of our most recent Good Thinking text book.
LOCATION:Engineering and Technology Building-427\, 1201 Locust Avenue\, Fairmont\, WV
URL:https://static.campuslabsengage.com/discovery/images/events/learning.jpg
END:VEVENT
