SUMMARY:Unity Friendship Bracelets
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a creative night of bracelet making designed to celebrate identity\, culture\, and community! Each color bead represents something meaningful\, whether its a value you hold\, a part of your heritage\, or a reminder of the community around you. Create a bracelet unique to you!
LOCATION:University Terrace North Lobby
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/9bee07bd-fbf2-42ae-a725-2b1755d6b99469a4d6e5-16dc-430c-b3e0-9b3c9c37c620.png
