DTSTAMP:20260803T173205Z
DTSTART:20250923T130000Z
DTEND:20250923T173000Z
SUMMARY:Exercise Science Career Exploration Fair
DESCRIPTION:You are invited to attend the Fairmont State University Exercise Science Career Exploration Fair Presented by Fairmont State University Encova Career Development Center\, and College of Health & Human Performance Date: Tuesday\, September 23\, 2025 Location: Falcon Center Conference Rooms 3rd Floor Employer Check-in: 9:00 AM- Fair start time-10:00 AM Fair concludes: 1:30 PM You're invited to connect with Exercise Science and Health students from Fairmont State University and local High School Juniors and Seniors. Learn from the University representatives to inform and educate potential career paths from a variety of disciplines\, including: Physical Therapy Occupational Therapy Sports Management Exercise Physiology Athletic Training Physicians Assistant Osteopathic Medicine Why Attend? Connect with emerging professionals in health and wellness fields Highlight graduate and advanced study opportunities.Reserve your space or for more information: Register via Handshake: Deadline to register is Monday\, September 15\, 2025 Email: careers@fairmontstate.edu Phone: 304-333-3670 We look forward to welcoming you to our campus!
LOCATION:Falcon Center Conference Rooms
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/f26950d9-b392-4d7b-97d6-056efd1c2bb8b52f6087-18bf-4c05-9707-b0457a111b33.png
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:11464408@fairmontstate.edu
DTSTAMP:20260803T173205Z
DTSTART:20250822T230000Z
DTEND:20250823T010000Z
SUMMARY:Reading night
DESCRIPTION:Join us to sit back and de-stress with a good book and relaxing ambiance! Enjoy free snacks and drinks!
LOCATION:University Terrace lobby
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/a1cf8946-817b-4403-aa9b-d974ccf88fbe225b31a7-bb1a-434b-a18c-e8b14a17ad7f.png
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:11464424@fairmontstate.edu
DTSTAMP:20260803T173205Z
DTSTART:20250925T140000Z
DTEND:20250925T173000Z
SUMMARY:Security and Justice Roundtable
DESCRIPTION:You're Invited: Fairmont State University Security & Justice Roundtable! Workforce Development Roundtable for Industry Leaders and Fairmont State University Faculty Members Hosted by Fairmont State University Career Development Center & The Office of Graduate and Professional Studies Join fellow industry leaders and Fairmont State University educators for a collaborative roundtable focused on strengthening workforce readiness and building the future talent pipeline for the security and justice fields. This exclusive event will explore innovative strategies\, including microcredentialing opportunities\,to align education with the evolving needs of your industry. Your voice is critical in helping shape curriculum and co-create practical learning pathways that equip students with in-demand skills and industry-recognized credentials. Why Attend? Influence the development of microcredentialing programs tailored to your field Collaborate directly with faculty and academic leaders Help shape a workforce that is career-ready on day one Network with industry peers and university partners Event Details Security and Justice Workforce Development RoundtableDate: Thursday\, September 25\, 2025Time: 10:00 AM 1:30 PM (Lunch provided)Location: Falcon Center Board Room\, 3rd FloorCampus Parking: Available in levels 15 of the Fairmont State University Parking Garage (Bryant Street Entrance to Fairmont State University) RSVP by Thursday\, September 4\, 2025 Contact:Susan Rodriguez susan.rodriguez@fairmontstate.edu Mary Sortino mary.sortino@fairmontstate.edu Andrew Cahall Andrew.cahall@fairmontstate.edu Lets work together to bridge the gap between education and employment.We look forward to partnering with you to develop career-ready graduates who meet the demands of todays workforce. Bottom of Form
LOCATION:Fairmont State University Falcon Center Conference Rooms\, 1201 Locust Avenue\, Fairmont\, WV
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/758a638b-5a14-42ad-b8ef-8423d0c6f1226dd4e92a-47d1-4709-bada-791858527c15.pdf
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:11464426@fairmontstate.edu
DTSTAMP:20260803T173205Z
DTSTART:20250924T200000Z
DTEND:20250924T220000Z
SUMMARY:Italy: "The Good Life!" A Presentation about Italian Culture
DESCRIPTION:La dolce vita\, the sweet life! Have you ever wondered what it really means to live "the good life?" Join us as Dr. Steven Mancini\, Honorary Consul of Italy\, Pittsburgh presents on all the simple pleasures of the Italian culture.
