SUMMARY:Fairmont State Vs Seton Hill WATCH PARTY!
DESCRIPTION:Football Watch Party at Feaster! Come cheer on your FALCONS! Join us at theFeaster Centerto watch the Falcons kick off their season against Seton Hill: Free Food Enjoy delicious game-day favorites while you watch every play. Door Prizes The first 20 people will get an EXCLUSIVE prize! Halftime Competition Join in the fun halftime challenge for a chance to take home bragging rights (and prizes!). Bring your friends\, bring your team spirit\, and dont miss out on the ultimate watch party!
