SUMMARY:LAUNDRY OLYMPICS
DESCRIPTION:Nothing makes the boring parts of college living better than a competition. By bringing a basket of laundry you will be able to enter the Laundry Olympics and compete with others to prove who is the best... or worst at doing their laundry. Make sure in your clean load of unfolded laundry there is at least 5 clean t-shirts\, a bunch of socks\, and your creativity. There will be awards given out at the end!
