SUMMARY:Monday Night Worship
DESCRIPTION:Come and see what Jesus is all about! We gather to worship God\, listen to Gods Word\, and have fun in community! Tonight\, there will be an afterparty held at the same location. We will have a Trivia Night & an Italian soda bar!
LOCATION:Trinity Assemblies of God\, 70 Maranatha Dr\, White Hall\, WV
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/2dbf1518-379b-4e3b-bb86-229fb47f1cf8c754f138-0c28-457b-827c-0c7c7aab939b.png
