UID:11484413@fairmontstate.edu
DTSTAMP:20260803T173206Z
DTSTART:20250904T210000Z
DTEND:20250904T223000Z
SUMMARY:Student Activities Tailgate - First Home Game!
DESCRIPTION:Get Game Day Ready!!! Kick off the season with us at the Student Activities Tailgate\, at 5:00pm - 6:30pm\,before the Fighting Falcons' first home game! We got FREE food(because nothing goes better with football than some free eats). Also\, Falcon Fanatics will have a tie dye station for rally towels\, run by Student Activities\, this is perfect for anyone who missed out during Welcome Week. Bring your friends\, grab some food\, make your towel\, and get loud for our Fairmont State Football Team! THE FOOTBALL GAME STARTS 7PM
LOCATION:The White Lot\, Duvall-Rosier Field\, Fairmont\, WV
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/86bb4e21-4301-4290-a9fb-bf1c49f46606782e360b-1773-4ba0-a723-6eb3f1804fa5.png
END:VEVENT
