DTSTART:20250911T220000Z
DTEND:20250911T233000Z
SUMMARY:Delight Ministries Kickoff
DESCRIPTION:Hey girls! On September 11th\, we will be hosting our first meeting! It will be the Kickoff to the semester! This will be where we reveal the giveaway winner (check out Instagram for a chance to win!)\, showcase the book\, and we will get to know each other! We will be serving iced coffees\, tea\, lemonade\, desserts\, and some snacks! We cannot wait to see you there!
LOCATION:Turley Center Room 106
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/2383c31b-749e-4cc0-9a1b-ce072e3dc52451ce3a77-4eb1-45d1-a016-bd21c0381863.png
