DTSTAMP:20260803T173206Z
DTSTART:20250925T210000Z
DTEND:20250925T230000Z
SUMMARY:RA Landon's Lightsaber Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Join RA Landon Reese in creating a customized personal foam lightsaber from Star Wars! This program is designed to promote creativity within the residential community through the use of social bonding and crafting skills! Materials will be provided and will be free to attendees to use for their creation. Come while supplies last!
LOCATION:Pence Hall Lobby
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/a2f37c19-ed1b-469c-bba5-fafd34fa110ab9504ad4-23be-4134-a4ea-77855c784783.png
