SUMMARY:Business and Industry Day _BSBA 2800 Students
DESCRIPTION:Fairmont State University Business & Industry DayFor BSBA 2800 Students Business & Industry Day connects BSBA 2800 students with top industry leaders for a unique\, hands-on professional development experience. Participants will gain valuable insights through: Resume Review: Receive direct feedback from professionals to make your resume stand out in competitive job markets. Interview Tips: Learn proven strategies to confidently navigate interviews and make a lasting impression. Mock Interviews: Practice interview skills with real industry leaders and receive constructive feedback to refine your approach. This interactive event bridges classroom learning with real-world expectations\, giving students the tools and confidence to enter todays workforce.
LOCATION:Falcon Center 304\, 1201 Locust Avenue\, Fairmont\, WV
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/7463b9e9-839b-4766-91b7-48872fba07eb4f4d7416-c1ce-48af-ac43-3434ac3aac29.png
