SUMMARY:Dr. Brian Beatty | HyFlex Guest Speaker Experience 
DESCRIPTION:In collaboration with the Center for Teaching and Learning Innovation (CTLI)\, Title III (PR/Award #P031A230090)is pleased to announce that Dr. Brian Beatty\, an expert in HyFlex teaching and course design\, will be joining us for an in-person campus visit. During this time\, we will offer opportunities for one-on-one conversation and collaborative workshops for instructors who are interested in or are currently teaching using a HyFlex mode. At the conclusion of the event\, HyFlex faculty will offer a demonstration for anyone who is interested in seeing how the Title III funded HyFlex technology functions during a typical class session.
