SUMMARY:RISE Welcome Dinner
DESCRIPTION:Hey\, College Fam! Have experience in foster care\, kinship care or just want to connect and support?Come hang with RISE for free food\, chill vibes\, and real community. Whether youre here to share your story or just meet people who get it\, this is a space for you. Were building a squad of students whove been through it and want to lift each other up while making the most of college life.Pull up\, eat good\, and meet some friends who get it. Wed love to see you there!
LOCATION:Turley Center 215\, 1201 Locust Avenue\, Fairmont\, West Virginia
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/ecc25208-912b-4e56-909d-e1235fce2831d21ee8ab-8bc0-4c75-a43d-fb5269c4f12f.png
