SUMMARY:Lunch and Learn | The Use of Humor by US presidents
DESCRIPTION:Presenter: Moshe Machlev The presentation will focus on the use of humor by US presidents as a rhetorical tool in different settings such as: the state of the union address\, press conferences\, and the White House correspondents dinner. Examples will be presented together with a communication framework and a psychological approach to interpretsuch use of humor.
