DESCRIPTION:Grab a costume and dance the evening away at the Folklife Center! This all ages\, free event\, curated by this year's Artist in Residence for the Presidential Series\, Annick Odom. It is the first of four university square dances this year. This event will be perfect for beginner and experienced square dancers alike and no partner is required. Costumes are optional\, but encouraged!
