SUMMARY:Paint and Sip
DESCRIPTION:Unwind\, get creative and enjoy a relaxing evening at Paint & Sip! Whether you're an experienced artist or just looking for a fun way to try something new\, this event is all about creativity and good vibes. Sip on a refreshing drink\, follow along with step-by-step guidance\, or let your imagination take over as you create your own masterpiece to take home. No experience necessary\, just a willingness to have fun! Seats are limited to 12 students per session Paint and Sips will be in one hour sessions\, each session is limited to 12 students. The first session will run from 6:00pm-7:00pm\, the second session will run from 7:00pm-8:00pm.
LOCATION:Turley Center Room 215 - Session 1
