SUMMARY:Fright Night w RA Gavin 
DESCRIPTION:Come join RA Gavin in a Halloween themed event to celebrate a spooky season. RA Gavin will provide food and drinks for the residents and whomever may attend. Enjoy this opportunity to come with or meet new friends and enjoy the new movie Sinners\, directed by Ryan Coogler. A story about two brothers escaping a daring past to find an even greater evil waiting for them.
