SUMMARY:Spirit Week: NEST Drive
DESCRIPTION:Help us support fellow Falcons through the NEST Drive\, a collection of food\, clothing\, and hygiene products for any student who needs them. Have you heard about the NEST? It is a wonderful place for students to come and pick up a snack\, a T-shirt or a bottle of shampoo at no cost to the student. We want to give back to such an amazing place! Each organization that donates clothing or hygiene products to the NEST from 9am to 4pm on Wednesday gets additional points added to their weekly score. We're accepting: Non-perishable Food Items Gently-Used Clothing Hygiene Products (Shampoo\, Toothpaste\, etc.) Every donation\, big or small\, makes a difference. Together\, we can keep the Falcon community strong\, supported\, and soaring high!
