DTSTAMP:20260803T173206Z
DTSTART:20250922T220000Z
DTEND:20250922T230000Z
SUMMARY:Fall Into Self-Care: DIY Body Scrubs
DESCRIPTION:Take a break and treat yourself to some seasonal self-care! Join us in making DIY body scrubs with cozy fall scents like pumpkin spice\, cinnamon\, and vanilla. Its a relaxing way to de-stress\, get creative\, and leave with a homemade scrub that will keep you feeling fresh and pampered all season long.
LOCATION:University Terrace North Lobby
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/dc76b052-5ced-43a7-b1ee-bed9f9c9308c4fc8e31e-43bf-4f01-9852-9620e650a717.png
