SUMMARY:Haunt Your Halls with Door-Decs
DESCRIPTION:Get into the spooky spirit with RA Molly and bring your creativity to life by painting your very own Halloween-themed doordecs! Whether youre all about ghosts\, pumpkins\, witches\, or cute little bats\, maybe even cats\, this is your chance to paint and decorate something fang-tastic for your door. Supplies will be provided\, such as the wooden door dec\, paint\, and command hooks to hang your new addition to your door. Just bring your imagination (and maybe a friend or two)! Lets make our halls a little more festive\, fun\, and frightfully welcoming this Halloween season. Cant wait to see you all there!
LOCATION:Morrow Hall
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/50d60a48-30f8-421d-8401-3b5988a0947e51eadc9e-3c56-4d59-a83e-d8c3c23864cb.png
