DESCRIPTION:Meghan McGinty\, owner of "Images by Meghan\," will be doing free Professionial Headshots for students! Visit the Falcon Center 1st Floor Lobby Area on September 30th\, October 2nd\, and October 7th from 10:00 am to 2:30 pm to get your headshot! Please note: these are Professional Headshots to aid your resume and professional social media applications (LinkedIn\, Handshake\, etc). It is important to wear professional clothing and Dress for Success! If you need professional clothing\, visit 233 Hardway Hall to browse the Career Closet!
