SUMMARY:Career Spotlight: CIA
DESCRIPTION:Representatives from the Directorate of Operations\, Central Intelligence Agency (CIA)\, will be offering an information session open to the entire Fairmont State community. This session will address CIA's mission\, how CIA is organized to accomplish that mission\, navigating the CIA website\, how and where to apply for careers and internships across the Agency\, what CIA values in competitive applicants\, and practical information that applicants can use to enhance their resumes and applications. A question-and-answer session will follow the formal information session.
