SUMMARY:Spirit Week: Great Falcon Bake Off
DESCRIPTION:Do you have what it takes to be crowned the best baker at Fairmont State? Join us for the Great Falcon Bake Off\, where students and organizations go head-to-head in a sweet showdown. What is your organization known for? If it's a signature dessert\, then you are in luck! Wow them with your creativity and let the best Falcon bakers win! From cookies and cupcakes to pies and pastries\, this is your chance to show off your baking skills and school spirit.
LOCATION:Falcon Center 1st Floor
