SUMMARY:Spirit Week: Homecoming Parade
DESCRIPTION:Show your Falcon pride and celebrate Homecoming in style at the Spirit Week Homecoming Parade! Student organizations\, athletics\, alumni\, and community groups will come together to march through Downtown Fairmont\, filling the streets with school spirit\, excitement\, and candy! We know that you want to show off your organization and where better to do that than the Homecoming Parade! One vehicle or float per organization. Make sure to sign up for the fun! Line up starts at 5pm on Everest Drive near the Fairmont Bowling Alley. The parade will start at 6pm. Bring your friends\, wear your maroon and white\, and line the streets to cheer on the Fighting Falcons!
LOCATION:Line Up: Near Fairmont Bowling Alley\, Everest Drive\, Fairmont\, WV
