SUMMARY:Exploration of Happiness in South American Countries 
DESCRIPTION:Move over Disney! If you're looking for the happiest places on Earth\, you might want to check out South America! Join us as Spanish teacher Blanca Skaggs discusses culture and happiness in places such as Venezuela and Peru. Discussion begins at 4:30pm.
