SUMMARY:Hiration Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Get your career tools ready! Career Services will guide you step by step through logging into the Hiration software\, crafting a strong resume that highlights your skills and experiences\, and learning how to leverage Handshake for career opportunities. This session is perfect for students who want to make sure their resumes stand out to employers. Struggling with introductions at career events? Learn how to craft a clear\, confident 3060 second elevator pitch to market yourself to employers. This workshop will help ease the anxiety of starting conversations and give you a polished introduction you can use at the Career Fair and beyond. Learn strong interview skills that will leverage your abilities beyond your competition.
LOCATION:ET Room 305\, 1201 Locust Ave\, Fairmont\, WV
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/973c29fa-19dd-45fb-aa15-602c85616c22d18bec87-86b0-44b2-b48d-8cd541ff6c0d.png
