SUMMARY:RISE Hat Burning
DESCRIPTION:These hats are anything but basic. Were teaming up with Emerge WV for a hands-on hat customizing event where youll learn how to wood burn your own design into a flat-brim suede hat or baseball cap. Yep were talking seriously cool\, one-of-a-kind headwear. Want to level it up? Add unique accessories like handmade hat bands\, feathers\, and more to make it fully you. Space is limited\, so RSVP by Sept. 18 to lock in your spot! RISE is a student community for those with foster or kinship care experience. Real support. Real connection. You belong here.
