SUMMARY:Creative Sustainability Council Meeting
DESCRIPTION:Fairmont State University's Creative Sustainability Council will be holding its first meeting of the semester on Friday\, September 12th\, at 2:00 PM in Jaynes 304. All faculty and students are welcome. We will be discussing the Creative Sustainability Council\, current sustainability projects and initiatives\, and how to propose new projects. Email Ryan Williams (rwilliams47@students.fairmontstate.edu) with any questions. Those who wish to attend virtually may do so using the Webex link:https://meet362.webex.com/meet362/j.php?MTID=mb0863c40deb835acde4ed75de1b150d4
