DTSTART:20250915T233000Z
DTEND:20250916T013000Z
SUMMARY:Monday Night Worship
DESCRIPTION:Come and see what Jesus is all about! We gather to worship God\, listen to Gods Word\, and have fun in community! There will be an afterparty held at the same location. Tonight we will have walking tacos and lemonade!
LOCATION:Trinity Assemblies of God\, 70 Marantha Dr\, Whitehall\, WV
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/2997e125-df72-4f84-b5a8-7a555a825fffa00a2ecd-f099-4975-a93c-f99bda55c714.png
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:11623228@fairmontstate.edu
DTSTAMP:20260803T173206Z
DTSTART:20251003T210000Z
DTEND:20251004T000000Z
SUMMARY:Fairmont State University Night at Poplar Island Pumpkins 
DESCRIPTION:Fairmont State University Night at the Poplar Island Pumpkin farm will be a night filled hayrides\, a cryptid trail\, and many different sizes of pumpkins! Come enjoy the fun\, and when mentioning Fairmont State\, you will get 50% off everything\, excluding pumpkins. As well as this\, we will be holding a costume contest\, so don't forget your costumes! Additionally\, we will be providing transportation from campus\, for students\, through Marion County Transit (MCTA)\, so come on out and join us for this spectacular event you won't want to miss! This event will be for students\, faculty and staff\, and the community\, everyone is welcome!
LOCATION:Poplar Island Pumpkin Farm\, 260 Poplar Island Rd\, Fairmont\, WV
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/320bb812-f133-4885-ad66-7c7e9e3f01cbbd2d38e2-ad45-4de6-8b4b-57e091420945.png
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:11623237@fairmontstate.edu
DTSTAMP:20260803T173206Z
DTSTART:20251002T220000Z
DTEND:20251003T010000Z
SUMMARY:Presidential Speaker Series: Dr. Charles Welch
DESCRIPTION:The President of the American Association of State Colleges and Universities\, Dr. Charles Welch will be giving a lecture\, starting at 6:00 pm about The Future of Regional Public Universities. President Davis will join Dr. Welch on stage for a fireside chat directly after the lecture. At the conclusion of the event\, there will be refreshments and complimentary cuisine. This event is open to faculty\, staff\, students\, and the community.
LOCATION:Falcon Center Conference Rooms
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/36b50622-c792-476c-80d0-b0c0ff6f9349773c8f55-00be-4bd1-9018-1f9641202f53.png
