UID:11642983@fairmontstate.edu
DTSTAMP:20260803T173206Z
DTSTART:20251120T010000Z
DTEND:20251120T040000Z
SUMMARY:Casino Night!
DESCRIPTION:Feeling lucky? Step into the thrill of Vegas right here on campus at Casino City hosted by Tjohne Productions! Test your skills (and your luck) at classic games like poker\, blackjack\, craps\, and roulette. Every player starts with $50\,000 in chips\, no real money needed\, just fun and bragging rights on the line! Come dressed to impress\, bring your poker face\, and see if you can hit the jackpot! Whether you're a card shark or a beginner\, Casino Night is your chance to roll the dice and have a great time with friends.
LOCATION:Colebank Hall Gym
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/f3125cd1-af5a-4995-bfc2-b2c90ae97fc5546ef801-eb8c-425b-94a7-c065594965be.png
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:11643022@fairmontstate.edu
DTSTAMP:20260803T173206Z
DTSTART:20251109T030000Z
DTEND:20251109T070000Z
SUMMARY:UP ALL NIGHT!
DESCRIPTION:Get ready for one of the biggest late-night events of the year\, UP ALL NIGHT! Stay up\, hang out\, and have a blast with an evening packed full of inflatables\, games\, music\, and FREE food. More information will be provided closer to the event. Bring your friends\, test your skills on the inflatables\, grab some food\, and dance the night away. It's all about fun and making memories that last well past midnight.
LOCATION:Falcon Center Gym 1 & Gym 2
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/93097dca-82c4-449a-b823-07232f166c1c06b72d51-7a26-4945-8ba8-f426664214b9.png
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:11643046@fairmontstate.edu
DTSTAMP:20260803T173206Z
DTSTART:20251009T163000Z
DTEND:20251009T173000Z
SUMMARY:Managing Your Student Organization Using Engage Fairmont State 
DESCRIPTION:We are excited to share that Engage Fairmont State is your central hub for managing your student organization at Fairmont State University. Through Engage\, you can: Update your roster and officer information Post upcoming events and meetings Track attendance at events and activities Upload your constitution\, bylaws\, and other important documents Communicate directly with members through announcements and messages Keeping your Engage page current is essential for maintaining your organizations recognition status and ensuring members stay connected. We encourage you to log in regularly and utilize the available tools to help your organization thrive. Join us to learn how to keep your organization's page up to date with upcoming events\, news articles\, and more!
LOCATION:Turley 215
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/810fe1a6-d7b3-417b-b291-7e53b5f116936acbf2fd-8a7c-43bd-8cb8-bcfc65c052a9.png
END:VEVENT
