UID:11643120@fairmontstate.edu
DTSTAMP:20260803T173206Z
DTSTART:20250918T164500Z
DTEND:20250918T171500Z
SUMMARY:General CTS Meeting
DESCRIPTION:Bi-weekly meeting
LOCATION:Engineering Tech Room 429
URL:https://static.campuslabsengage.com/discovery/images/events/social.jpg
