DTSTART:20250917T230000Z
DTEND:20250918T013000Z
SUMMARY:Falcon Soccer Game Day
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an exciting night as we show support to our team at one of the most important soccer games of the season!Come cheer\, connect with friends\, and be part of the energy on game day
LOCATION:Duvall-Rosier Field\, Campus Dr E\, Fairmont\, WV 26554
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/75b36886-097f-445f-9a5f-488de2d726123bd5118c-d932-4c36-b832-a3822a90f168.png
