DTSTAMP:20260803T173206Z
DTSTART:20260212T230000Z
DTEND:20260213T020000Z
SUMMARY:Presidential Speaker Series: Dr. Michael Lee
DESCRIPTION:The Professor and Director of the Civility Initiative\, College of Charleston (SC)\, Dr. Michael Lee will be giving a lecture starting at 6:00 pm about Civility and Dialog Across Differences.
LOCATION:Falcon Center Conference Rooms
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/806173fb-bc78-493c-be6e-6bf7f55c27c9ef0e855f-f36a-4933-9781-40210725b9d4.png
