UID:11643140@fairmontstate.edu
DTSTAMP:20260803T173206Z
DTSTART:20250926T200000Z
DTEND:20250926T220000Z
SUMMARY:Kitchen Classics
DESCRIPTION:Join ARD Landon to learn some cooking skills and some great recipes! You'll learn knife skills\, cooking techniques\, and get to enjoy a meal you cooked yourself!
LOCATION:Prichard Kitchen\, 1st Floor
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/8161f0bb-8362-49f3-86c4-1085f5aef3b532b1e56f-ce2b-4b4f-8d68-bd43bd073c25.png
