BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:11643182@fairmontstate.edu
DTSTAMP:20260803T173206Z
DTSTART:20251115T150000Z
DTEND:20251115T163000Z
SUMMARY:Fighting Falcon Tailgate with Student Activities & SVO
DESCRIPTION:It's game day Falcons! Join Student Activities and the Student Veterans Organization (SVO) for a tailgate full of food\, fun\, and Falcon Pride before the Fighting Falcons take the field. FREE food to fuel up before the game\, hang out with your friends to show some spirit for the Football team\, and have the chance to connect with SVO members. KICK-OFF IS AT 12PM Come celebrate campus pride\, show support for our wonderful veterans\, and get hyped for kickoff. Let's make this tailgate one to remember\, because when Falcons come together\, we soar! Let's Falcon GO!!!
LOCATION:The White Lot\, Duvall-Rosier Field\, Fairmont\, WV
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/a7dbbfa2-28c8-4fd0-850c-ebbdb1cb301d6435acd7-87ea-4b65-8121-7928cd9ae0fe.png
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:11643190@fairmontstate.edu
DTSTAMP:20260803T173206Z
DTSTART:20251001T230000Z
DTEND:20251002T010000Z
SUMMARY:Macbeth. Presented by the Rustic Mechanicals 
DESCRIPTION:Don't miss a special performance of Shakespeare's Macbeth! Proudly presented by the West Virginia Shakespeare Group The Rustic Mechanicals as their 2025 Vaulting Ambition Tour makes a stop at Fairmont State University on Wednesday\, October 1st in the Wallman Hall Theatre. The show starts at 7:00pm and admission is free! See you there!
LOCATION:Wallman Hall\, 1201 Locust Avenue\, Fairmont\, WV
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/6f1fd28a-a480-4411-af41-300a7032340c1e272675-cd67-470a-a36c-860f72521693.png
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:11653034@fairmontstate.edu
DTSTAMP:20260803T173206Z
DTSTART:20251106T160000Z
DTEND:20251106T190000Z
SUMMARY:DIY Oil Diffuser
DESCRIPTION:Bring a little relaxation into your space with your own handmade oil diffuser! At this DIY event\, you'll get all the supplies you need to create a custom diffuser. Perfect for making your room or dorm smell amazing! Choose your favorite scents and take home your own personal scent as a oil diffuser. It's a simple way to de-stress\, recharge\, and create a little calm in your day.
LOCATION:Main Street - Falcon Center
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/15db3a07-8efb-439c-b370-3ed86f370329791edad4-5d94-4928-a555-2c0e1a73e21d.png
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:11653105@fairmontstate.edu
DTSTAMP:20260803T173206Z
DTSTART:20250929T120000Z
DTEND:20250930T000000Z
SUMMARY:Homecoming Board Creation
DESCRIPTION:Get ready to pump up the spirit and show off your creativity! Join us for a fun-filled session where YOU can create your very own Homecoming Board to represent your class\, club\, or just your Falcon pride! Well provide everything you need :boards\, paint\, pomping tissue\, and more!!All you have to bring is your school spirit and a few creative ideas.Turley 215 will be open all day with the materials and space available so make sure to stop by to work our your boards.These boards will be displayed around campus during Homecoming week and they will be judged on Tuesday\, Oct 7th by our judges panel for Spirit Week points!!
LOCATION:Turley 215\, 1201 Locust Ave\, Fairmont\, WV
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/c77eeb2a-e595-4085-81e2-ba18ed53dbeffce35eed-5470-408f-891c-3a6564022935.png
END:VEVENT
