DTSTAMP:20260803T173206Z
DTSTART:20251016T210000Z
DTEND:20251016T230000Z
SUMMARY:Bingo Night!
DESCRIPTION:Test your luck and join us for a fun-filled Bingo Night! Bring your friends\, grab a card\, and see if you can call out that winning "Bingo!" along the way. We will run multiple rounds to play and there will be some prizes up for grabs!
