DTEND:20250925T220000Z
SUMMARY:Italian Dance Workshop
DESCRIPTION:An exciting 60MIN Italian dance workshop followed by Q & A. Learn traditional authentic dances from various regions of Italy. 2 tarantellas will be offered PLUS History and stories behind the movement. No shoes required. No dance experience required
LOCATION:Gym 2\, Falcon Center
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/cbe3c74f-baae-42dd-8ebf-7a3c2700d0c5d8f8724e-dae2-4f1a-bef1-d9d658a22ada.png
