DTSTART:20250930T150000Z
DTEND:20250930T180000Z
SUMMARY:Succulent Plant Stop-By
DESCRIPTION:Bring some life to your dorm with your very own succulent plant! Join us on Main Street in the Falcon Center where you can pick out a succulent and pot it to take back to your room. Succulents are low-maintenance and the perfect way to add a little green to your space. Supplies can be limited\, so be sure to stop by and create your new dorm room companion!
LOCATION:Main Street - Falcon Center
