SUMMARY:Steeping with Hope - Holiday Tea
DESCRIPTION:Join us for the annual Holiday Tea\, Steeping with Hope. Our goal for this tea\, always\, is to gather donations for HOPE\, inc. who provides victims of Domestic Violence with necessary resources. Please help us give back by bringing clothing\, toiletries\, towels\, etc. to support the victims in need.
LOCATION:Shaw House
