SUMMARY:Trunk or Treat & President Mike's Movie Night
DESCRIPTION:Join us for Trunk or Treat\, headed by Student Affairs\, on the top floor of the FSU parking garage\, and don't forget your costumes! Directly following\, join us for 'President Mike's Movie Night' in Colebank Gym\, where we will be playing 'The Nightmare Before Christmas.' The 'Movie Night' portion will also include some free treats and delicious drinks\, stick around and watch the movie to be eligible for these! Faculty\, staff\, students\, and the community are invited to this event\, we can't wait to see you there!
LOCATION:FSU Parking Garage - Top Floor
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/ecc7ecf9-73ea-451b-ab0c-5ec0a71cc89759b1c5fb-3551-4863-aadf-7e38fee3c259.png
END:VEVENT
