UID:11684711@fairmontstate.edu
DTSTAMP:20260803T173206Z
DTSTART:20251009T204500Z
DTEND:20251009T210000Z
SUMMARY:Transportation to the Homecoming Parade
DESCRIPTION:Need a ride to downtown Fairmont for the parade? Make sure to RSVP for one of the 15 spots on the bus. The bus leaves from the Feaster Center at 4:45 PM. RISE is a student community for those with foster or kinship care experience. Real support. Real connection. You belong here.
LOCATION:Feaster Center
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/d4ae625f-b014-4e41-8832-8383c407b0b6f63ea5ca-0a59-4301-867d-e5b8ec61d2d6.png
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:11684718@fairmontstate.edu
DTSTAMP:20260803T173206Z
DTSTART:20251009T190000Z
DTEND:20251009T230000Z
SUMMARY:Homecoming Float Decorating Party + Parade
DESCRIPTION:Join us as we bring our creativity to life and represent RISE in this years Homecoming Parade! We'll be adding a little flair to RISE's parade vehicle to show off our spirit\, energy\, and what makes our group unique. Snacks\, music\, and good vibes guaranteed. We'll meet at 3:00PM in front of Prichard to decorate\, then head to the parade lineup to walk in the parade & pass out candy as a group. After the parade\, we'll hang out at the Homecoming Bonfire on campus! RISE is a student community for those with foster or kinship care experience. Real support. Real connection. You belong here.
LOCATION:Prichard Hall
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/70b4b429-5eb3-454b-bade-85df511122da3b19c180-9a7a-464b-93cb-1ca0685d5d5e.png
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:11684784@fairmontstate.edu
DTSTAMP:20260803T173206Z
DTSTART:20250924T223000Z
DTEND:20250924T233000Z
SUMMARY:Paint and Sip Fundraiser
DESCRIPTION:For $10\, receive a canvas\, paints\, and brushes to create a masterpiece! Work along with an artist who can give you tips and show you his process.
LOCATION:Engineering Technology Building 209\, 1201 Locus Ave\, Fairmont\, West Virginia
URL:https://static.campuslabsengage.com/discovery/images/events/artsandmusic.jpg
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:11687574@fairmontstate.edu
DTSTAMP:20260803T173206Z
DTSTART:20251013T223000Z
DTEND:20251013T233000Z
SUMMARY:Keynote Speaker: "The Resilient Falcon: A Night of Comedy\, Courage\, and Conversations that Matter"
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an educational comedy show featuring\, Josh Rivedalcollege student mental health/suicide prevention specialist\, author\, writer for The Huffington Post\, and Philadelphia-based standup comedian. He is a keynote speaker that combines standup comedy and mental health/suicide prevention. Founder of "The i'Mpossible Project". Cookies\, beverages\, and raffling off prizes to all who attend.
LOCATION:3rd Floor Falcon Center Conference Room\, 1201 Locust Ave\, Fairmont\, WV
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/0385188b-4396-49c8-b6d0-b58b3ad74830ae48f352-cfd6-4589-9dfd-238683e2020f.png
END:VEVENT
