SUMMARY:Fairmont State Emeritus Luncheon
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a memorable afternoon of celebration and connection at the Fairmont State Emeritus Luncheon\, where we proudly honor the Class of 1975. This special event brings together alumni\, faculty\, students\, and friends of the University to celebrate the lasting legacy and remarkable contributions of these distinguished graduates. Purchase your tickets here: https://www.fsufoundation.org/alumni-luncheon.html
