UID:11693909@fairmontstate.edu
DTSTAMP:20260803T173206Z
DTSTART:20251017T143000Z
DTEND:20251017T230000Z
SUMMARY:Financial Fun & Fall Haul
DESCRIPTION:RISE members: You're invited to a jam-packed day of fun\, food\, and financial freedom! Well kick things off with lunch at Mountain State Brewery in Bridgeport \, followed by Reality Day with Huntington Bank where you'll get hands-on experience with budgeting and financial planning. No boring lectures - just real-life learning made fun\, interactive\, and tailored to YOUR personal needs! After that\, well head to Meadowbrook Mall to shop with a banker and put your new budgeting skills into action. Well wrap up the day close to campus for a cozy bonfire\, chili\, and smores at the Wesley Foundation house. A bus will take us everywhere\, so all you have to do is show up to Prichard Hall in the morning and enjoy the day - we leave at 10:30 AM! Spots are limited. All participants must RSVP through Engage in advance and be enrolled as active members in RISE. Enrollment form available at https://forms.office.com/r/ZZU0V6Zvb6 Please reach out to the RISE team if you have any questions! RISE is a student community for those with foster or kinship care experience. Real support. Real connection. You belong here.
LOCATION:Prichard Hall
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/33c9a89d-4010-42ef-87aa-df360533cfadb60bb514-21ff-49d6-a149-4462bf6a3057.png
END:VEVENT
