DTEND:20251002T200000Z
SUMMARY:Student Check-In with Dr. Charles Welch
DESCRIPTION:Come have a chat with Dr. Charles Welch\, the first Presidential Speaker of the new series\, at Starbucks\, the first 20 students get free Starbucks Drink Vouchers! If you love President Mike\, you will love President Chuck!
LOCATION:Starbucks - Falcon Center
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/ae9a755b-41d7-40f5-8abb-fd75f3470f0744b5b13c-5a2b-4d9e-96d8-71a73eb3be87.pdf
