SUMMARY:Graduate Assistant Information Session
DESCRIPTION:Thinking About Grad School? Learn How a GA Can Support Your Next Step. Join us for a Graduate Assistant Interest Session to learn about: What a GA is and the many ways GAs support our campus. The benefitsincluding a tuition waiver\, stipend\, and valuable professional development. The application and hiring timeline for Spring 2026 and Fall 2026 positions. Date & Time:Thursday\, October 23 at 12:30 PM- 1:15 PMLocation:Turley 215 and Microsoft Teams:Join the meeting now Graduate Assistantships are one of the best ways to continue your Falcon journey while gaining real-world experience and financial support. We look forward to showing you how a GA position can make graduate school the right next step for you!
LOCATION:Turley Center 215
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/f6a16148-f5b2-4867-9e1f-9b5793fbdca8df169b36-ec21-4160-a7d6-e0de0e332d17.png
