SUMMARY:Visit the NEST
DESCRIPTION:Hey Falcons! We know that college life can be stressful\, and sometimes\, finding your next meal shouldn't be one of those worries. That's whereThe Nest Student Food Bankcomes in! Whether you're facing a tough week or just need a little extra support\, The Nest is here for youwith free\, nutritious food options to keep you fueled and focused. No judgment\, no hasslejust a welcoming space where you can get what you need. Remember\, taking care of yourself is part of success. So if you or a fellow Falcon could use a helping hand\, dont hesitate to stop by The Nest. We're all in this together
LOCATION:Falcon Center\, 1201 Locust Ave 1201 Locust Ave\, Fairmont\, WV
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/23008fb5-f72a-45a8-a5a3-f6cb31586916f0d31ba7-0e27-418d-be75-d1e347ef41ea.png
END:VEVENT
