SUMMARY:STEAM Career Fair
DESCRIPTION:Level up your future at the STEAM Career Fair on Thursday\, November 6\, 2025\, in Falcon Center Gym 1 from 10:00 a.m.2:00 p.m. Meet top employers from Science\, Technology\, Engineering\, Architecture\, and Math who are hiring for internships\, co-ops\, and full-time roles. Network with recruiters\, discover emerging career paths\, and showcase your skillsbring copies of your resume\, Dress for Success (Career Closet is available!)\, and be ready to make a great first impression. All majors welcome. Stop by between classes and take the next step toward your career! SOAR Falcons! Students may register using the link below: https://app.joinhandshake.com/career_fairs/fc66ef43-51c1-40fa-bbfb-7f852fa05184/student_preview
LOCATION:Falcon Center Gym 1\, 1201 Locust Avenue\, Fairmont\, WV
