SUMMARY:Suicide Awareness & Healing Our Community
DESCRIPTION:An open and mindful event to raise mental health awareness around campus. Which consists of a presentation regarding mental health statistics\, history\, and helpful resources pertaining to suicidal awareness. As well as an expressive painting activity that encourages students to check-in mentally with themselves and keep them grounded.
