DTEND:20251014T200000Z
SUMMARY:LibLEADpalooza
DESCRIPTION:Ready for the ultimate library adventure? October 14 from 9am to 4pm\, grab your friends and sink cornhole shots in the 24/7 Lab\, drift through Mario Kart on our new Switch 2 on second floor\, and test your skills with mini-mini golf on the third floor! Claim your Passport bookmark and complete the challenge for your shot at the grand prize! Plus enjoy free snacks along the way! Wrap it all up at the LEAD Centers Meet the Team party from 46 PM with catered food\, a DJ\, and even more fun! Come to the library October 14 to play\, explore\, and earn your bragging rights (and maybe the grand prize)!
LOCATION:Ruth Ann Musick Library\, 1201 Locust Avenue Ruth Ann Musick Library\, Fairmont\, WV
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/699e9df3-35a5-4d4f-aaa6-c1d4ca2af1903bd135b8-f8b9-45ad-aba5-651a9d545757.png
