SUMMARY:RISE: Trunk-or-Treat
DESCRIPTION:Join the Rise Fam for Trunk-or-Treat! Well be decorating a trunk and handing out candy to all the spooky (and not-so-spooky) members of our community. Throw on your best costume\, bring your Halloween spirit\, and get ready for a night of fun\, friends\, and plenty of tricks and treats! We'll meet at Prichard to decorate our trunk\, and head to the first floor of the FSU Parking Garage to hand out some treats! RISE is a student community for those with foster or kinship care experience. Real support. Real connection. You belong here.
