SUMMARY:RISE RSO Meeting
DESCRIPTION:Come join us for our first RISE meeting! Well be talking about upcoming events\, campus resources\, leadership roles\, and how we can better support each other as a community of foster/kinship care alumni. Whether you were in foster care\, adopted\, aged out\, or reunifiedthis is a space for you. All are welcome\, and your voice matters. RISE is a student community for those with foster or kinship care experience. Real support. Real connection. You belong here.
