SUMMARY:Foundations of Investment with Tiffany Osman of Equitable Advisors
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an engaging classroom session with Tiffany Osman of Equitable Advisors as she shares insights on the Foundations of Investment. Whether youre new to the world of finance or looking to strengthen your knowledge\, this session will provide valuable guidance on key principles and practical strategies for building a strong financial future. Monday\, October 6\, 2025 1:30 PM Jaynes Hall\, Room 103 Dont miss this opportunity to learn from an experienced financial professional and gain tools that can help shape your financial decision-making for years to come.
LOCATION:Jaynes Hall Room 103\, 1201 Locust Ave\, Fairmont\, WV
