SUMMARY:Fright night Karaoke
DESCRIPTION:Get ready to sing your heart out under the spooky spotlight! Join us for a frightfully fun Halloween Karaoke Night at University Terrace. Whether youre belting out your favorite monster mash-up\, performing a chilling ballad\, or just cheering on your fellow ghosts and ghouls\, this is the perfect way to celebrate the season. Come dressed in your best costume (optional\, but encouraged!) and enjoy a night of music\, laughter\, and Halloween spirit. Well have snacks\, and plenty of spooky vibes to keep the energy high.
LOCATION:UT Lobby
URL:https://static.campuslabsengage.com/discovery/images/events/artsandmusic.jpg
END:VEVENT
