SUMMARY:Spooky Safety Tips
DESCRIPTION:Happy Halloween! Come down to the North Lobby to learn some tips to keep yourself safe while going out and having a good time on Halloween! It is super important to stay safe on holidays like this so we want to help our residents to be aware. We will have hand out flyers as well so you take your knowledge with you! Make sure to grab some candy too since it is Halloween!
