SUMMARY:WV Storytelling Guild Youth Storytelling Workshop 
DESCRIPTION:Experienced tellers will model traditional storytelling including folktales\, fairytales\, myth/legend\, tall tales\, ghost stories\, and personal narratives. The day will end with a fun-filled 'story slam. Registration is required. Please e-mail Fran Kirk atFrancene.kirk@gmail.com for additional information and to register.
