SUMMARY:Foster The Future Networking Night + Community Dinner
DESCRIPTION:Come hang out for a meaningful and empowering evening where youll connect with other college students and adult mentors whove also experienced life after foster care. This is your space to share your story\, get support\, ask questions\, and meet people who really get where youre coming from. Whether youre looking for advice\, inspiration\, or just someone to talk toyoure not alone. Plus\, well have a free community dinner (yep\, actual good food!) provided by our awesome volunteers. Come for the meal\, stay for the real talk and good vibes. RISE is a student community for those with foster or kinship care experience. Real support. Real connection. You belong here.
LOCATION:215 Turley Center
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/bc59b09d-bca5-4ec5-9b24-2e0fe97c1011fa8fc6bc-2185-4c35-bbab-b3fcf287b5b8.png
