SUMMARY:Slingshot Challenge Project Day
DESCRIPTION:We are partnering with Mountain Sol and National Geographic to host the Slingshot Challenge. The Slingshot Challenge invites 13-18-year-olds to submit a 1-minute video describing their idea for solving environmental issues. Students will participate in an on-campus workday and then will work virtually with mentors to finalize and submit their projects to National Geographic by February 8\, 2026. Videos will be screened in both statewide and international film festivals for a chance to win prizes! RISE is a student community for those with foster or kinship care experience. Real support. Real connection. You belong here.
LOCATION:215 Turley Center
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/e993f15d-2411-4254-9e67-bc76cd4b70f49ed6ccca-589f-4262-acda-0b7cd6eadb9e.png
