SUMMARY:Alpha Psi Omega Centennial Celebration
DESCRIPTION:Join us on Sunday\, November 2ndfor the Centennial Celebration of Alpha Psi Omega in the Art Gallery of Wallman Hall from 4:00pm - 6:00pm immediately following the conclusion of the closing of the Fall show\, Peter and the Starcatcher. This Honorary Theatre Society was founded here at Fairmont State in 1925 and has grown to a national organization with over 900 established chapters throughout the United States. APO will celebrate it's 100th anniversary at the Come out and enjoy this wonderful show and stay for small reception to celebrate 100 years of APO!
LOCATION:Wallman Hall Art Gallery\, 1201 Locust Avenue Jaynes Hall Room 311\, Fairmont\, WV 26554
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/bd1a2e83-f438-4fa7-801c-7f9a573522996f40acd5-04e0-4ff7-ba73-bdfd5394da80.png
