SUMMARY:Shaping Success Together: Insights from Faculty
DESCRIPTION:The goals of this session are: Explore what information and tools faculty need to support students effectively and efficiently. Identify key needs and opportunities for enhancing the tool to create more space for meaningful conversations with students. Talk through pain points with the system and brainstorm ways to improve the experience for faculty. The target audience is: Faculty The session will be in Hardway 219.
LOCATION:Hardway 219
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/d0662cba-d098-46d3-85a9-c1035058778191a369a0-dc41-41ae-8ddb-b680dd570cc4.png
