DTSTAMP:20260803T173206Z
DTSTART:20251020T130000Z
DTEND:20251020T141500Z
SUMMARY:Shaping Success Together: Insights from Professional Advisors & Student Success Coaches
DESCRIPTION:The goals for this session are to: Share successes and highlight how Navigate360 has supported student advising and coaching to date. Identify key needs and opportunities for enhancing the tool to better support daily mentoring. Discuss barriers to adoption and co-create solutions to strengthen utilization moving forward. The recommended attendees are: Professional advisors and Student Success Coaches.
LOCATION:Hardway 219
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/bee8993b-c347-4852-be8d-79569a9fccc16e0ceb3a-8c9b-4caa-a54d-fb4de8f54f06.png
