SUMMARY:STEM Roundtable 2nd Session with Employers and Faculty
DESCRIPTION:Fairmont State Universitys Graduate Studies\, College of Science and Technology\, and Encova Career Development Center is pleased to invite you to participate in our 2nd STEM Workforce Roundtable\, scheduled for Thursday\, October 30\, 2025\, from 12:00 p.m. to 2:00 p.m. in the Falcon Center Conference Room (3rd Floor). We greatly appreciate the valuable insights and collaboration provided by employers during our initial meeting on April 15\, 2025. Your contributions helped set the groundwork for aligning academic programs with workforce needs across our STEM disciplines. As we reconvene\, our goal is to continue that progressexpanding discussions on curriculum alignment\, work-based learning\, and micro-credentialing opportunities. Together\, we can identify practical strategies to strengthen the regional talent pipeline and prepare students for the evolving demands of todays workforce. Key Discussion Topics Integrating employer feedback into STEM curriculum development Expanding internship\, co-op\, and apprenticeship opportunities Identifying micro-credentials and certifications valued by industry Strengthening early student engagement and career readiness initiatives Exploring new technologies and skills shaping the future workforce Your continued partnership and expertise are vital to this initiative\, and we look forward to your participation in shaping the next phase of collaboration between education and industry. Please RSVP by Thursday\, October 23\, 2025\, to confirm your attendance. If you have any questions or wish to suggest additional discussion topics\, feel free to contact me directly. Parking:Complimentary parking is available in the parking garage (Levels 15\, #16) or in the lot behind the Education Building (#4). Warm regards\,Mary Sortino & Susan Rodriguez Chair-Graduate Studies Senior Director of Career Services
LOCATION:Fairmont State University Falcon Center Conference Rooms 301-302\, 1201 Locust Avenue\, Fairmont\, WV
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/248e7d7e-e9b5-4b71-8de5-f620b22c5ec5e20d8375-3c09-47d5-962b-6b306747e633.png
STATUS:CANCELLED
END:VEVENT
