SUMMARY:An Early Mindful pause
DESCRIPTION:Residents take a few quiet minutes at the start of the day to pause\, breathe\, and reset before classes or daily activities. This simple break encourages mindfulness and helps set a calm\, intentional\, and productive tone for the rest of the day. This helps to tackle future tasks with a clear mind.
LOCATION:university terrace north\, fairmontstate
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/32472641-214f-412c-8e2f-a7c15a683ec866c00ceb-257b-4707-a039-685506a24af0.png
