DTEND:20251028T000000Z
SUMMARY:Mini Me Keychains
DESCRIPTION:Mini Me Keychains is a creative and engaging activity where residents will design their own keychains using shrinking paper. Participants can draw\, write\, or decorate their designs to express something meaningful about themselves such as their hobbies\, values\, favorite quotes\, or symbols that represent their identity. After decorating\, the designs will be baked to shrink and harden\, turning them into personalized keychains. This activity encourages self-expression while providing a relaxed\, social environment for residents to connect and learn more about one another.
LOCATION:University Terrace North Lobby
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/8d04d98c-e8f9-428f-84bf-55aad81fee017ad40cb6-273c-4a6b-bf85-8fe3c0c13685.png
END:VEVENT
