UID:11776518@fairmontstate.edu
DTSTAMP:20260803T173206Z
DTSTART:20251024T003000Z
DTEND:20251024T023000Z
SUMMARY:Karaoke Roulette
DESCRIPTION:Think youve got what it takes to sing whatever the folded paper decides? Join RA Molly for a night full of laughter\, surprises\, and music at Karaoke Roulette! Heres how it works: instead of choosing your song\, youll pick a folded piece of paper from the basket. There will be a theme that you choose from\, and whatever theme you get\, you will have to pick a song from that basket that has the theme's name on it\, and that's not all. There will be a challenge in each song chosen\, such as singing in a certain accent or singing while jumping. The themes can be anything from a Disney classic to a throwback jam to a power ballad! Whether youre a confident performer or just here for fun\, this is your chance to let loose\, cheer on your friends\, and make some unforgettable memories.
LOCATION:Morrow Hall
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/581e2fd2-7053-48e5-9554-37f00c656699a1e227c7-f1ae-4550-9faf-fbe87013b925.png
END:VEVENT
