DTEND:20260325T173000Z
SUMMARY:All Majors Spring Career Fair
DESCRIPTION:Fairmont State University invites studentsto our All MajorsSpring Career Fair on Thursday\, March 25\, 2026\, from 10:00 AM to 1:30 PM in the Falcon Center Gym 1 and 2. Connect with local\, regional\, and national employers\, submit resumes\, explore job and internship opportunities\, and strengthen your networking skills. Students can also take advantage of the Career Closet\, offering free professional attire\, and receive complimentary professional headshots to enhance their resumes and LinkedIn profiles. Dress professionally\, bring multiple copies of your resume\, and prepare to take the next step in your career journey. Hosted by the Encova Career Development Center\, this event is open to all students and alumni. Students\, please register via this link:https://app.joinhandshake.com/career_fairs/514271c9-61a7-47d0-ab0d-085c269bd8d6/student_preview The first 250 students to attend will receive a free padfolio!
LOCATION:Falcon Center Gym 1 and Gym 2\, 1201 Locust Ave\, Fairmont\, WV
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/39320447-2a21-44fd-98f9-3292a1274cde46648fdf-caf2-4941-9b3a-8154d49d329c.png
