BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:11798725@fairmontstate.edu
DTSTAMP:20260803T173206Z
DTSTART:20251020T160000Z
DTEND:20251020T170000Z
SUMMARY:Commuter Appreciation Week
DESCRIPTION:Join us next week\,October 20-24th\, as we highlight and celebrate our commuter students! Throughout the week\, well be hosting a variety of events and activities to show our appreciation for the commuter students here at Fairmont State.Enjoy snacks\, beverages\, and most importantlyPRIZES! Monday 10.20.25- Spot the Freddie Find the 4 Freddie cutouts around town & campus. Take a picture and upload it to win a prize! Tuesday 10.21.25- Curbside Cafe 8AM-11AM enjoy free Coffee & Donuts at the entrance to the parking garage Wednesday 10.22.25- Golfcart Karaoke Catch staff/faculty riding around campus in the Golfcart. Stop and sing to win a prize! Thursday 10.23.25- BINGO Night Come enjoy a BINGO night from 5pm-7pm in Falcon Center Conference Rooms! Come enjoy the food and win prizes! Friday 10.24.25- Free Car Kits Enjoy our free car kits being given out to the first 100commuter students at the top of the parking garagefrom 8am-12pm. This is our way of saying thank you to the students who travel near and far to be part of the Falcon family. Dont miss out\, come celebrate with us!
LOCATION:Fairmont\, WV
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/17d461e1-e1e9-444f-94e6-ca27cc08e62297934402-4f78-4d6f-8dda-2ce2a1dc7a0f.png
END:VEVENT
