SUMMARY:Halloween Costume Dance Party
DESCRIPTION:Haunt the Ruth Ann Musick Library lobby for our Halloween Costume Dance Party on October 28 from 79 PM! Let your spirits rise to the dance floor after our spine-chilling short story reading of Ruth Ann Musick ghost tales in MMA from 6-7pm. Wear your best Halloween costume and enjoy killer tracks spun from a live DJ\, bewitchin refreshments\, and a costume contest so fierce its scary. One lucky ghoul with the best costume will snatch the GRAND PRIZE! Dont ghost the biggest library party of the year! Dance til youre undead at Ruth Ann Musick library\, October 28.
LOCATION:Ruth Ann Musick Library\, Lobby
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/41a94073-2711-46e8-8a9f-556a9f89ea81973a9374-2410-4cb7-839e-2e5594ccd88d.png
END:VEVENT
