DTSTAMP:20260803T173206Z
DTSTART:20251104T220000Z
DTEND:20251104T233000Z
SUMMARY:RISE RSO Meeting
DESCRIPTION:Your voice matters! At this months meeting\, well plan upcoming events and collaborate on a vision for a RISE mentorship program that truly supports students designed by you\, for you. Whether you were in foster care\, adopted\, aged out\, or reunifiedthis is a space for you. All are welcome\, and your voice matters. RISE is a student community for those with foster or kinship care experience. Real support. Real connection. You belong here.
LOCATION:217 Turley Center
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/0d618dd7-72ed-4e78-80ed-f771001cf5beb2a02faa-c820-4116-b584-3ba872bb6522.png
END:VEVENT
