SUMMARY:Intramural Semester Celebration 
DESCRIPTION:Join us on Wednesday\, December 3rd from 68 PM in Gym 2 for our Intramural Semester Celebration! Were bringing back all your favorite intramural games from the semester\, plus light snacks and great music. Come hang out\, play\, and celebrate the end of the semester with us!
