SUMMARY:Turley After Dark Alien/Glow Night!
DESCRIPTION:Get ready for an out-of-this-world experience at this years Turley After Dark! Join us on Tuesday\, November 5th\, from 69 PM in the Turley Ballroom for an Alien/Glow Night a cosmic-themed evening full of fun\, connection\, and glowing vibes! This free event is open to all students\, but RSVPs are limited! Event Highlights Include: Glow-in-the-dark games and DIY crafts Meet & Greet with Success Coaches Free themed food and snacks Photo booth to capture the glowing memories Hosted by your Success Coaches\, Turley After Dark is your chance to unwind\, connect\, and have a blast. Come as you are or suit up in your best alien-inspired glow gear and light up the night with us!
LOCATION:Turley Center\, 1201 Locust Ave Turley Center 3rd Floor\, Fairmont\, WV
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/07818b31-861f-4bb9-965f-6cb097e92da78a411640-d3d5-4d4b-bd44-1782c9695a02.png
