SUMMARY:The Role of Religion on the Colonial Frontier 
DESCRIPTION:Join Dr. J. L. Tomlin as he presents The Role of Religion on the Colonial Frontier as part of the Hacker's Creek Pioneer Descendants Lecture Series. Lectures are held at the Central WV Genealogy & History Library\, whose mission is to collect\, preserve\, share\, and display the history\, culture\, and artifacts to those interested in their own personal family history and the culture of Central West Virginia. This event isfree and open to the public.
LOCATION:WV Central Genealogy & History Library\, 45 Abbott's Run Rd\, Horner\, WV
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/ecc22b86-b200-43d3-97b6-56055f95e9ee7554a9e1-881f-4686-89d8-9a0940e33c78.png
