SUMMARY:The Lift Alliance Leadership Committee Meeting
DESCRIPTION:Join us for our next Lift Alliance meetinga time for our dedicated volunteer leaders to come together in support of college students with child welfare experience. Well brainstorm\, strategize\, and plan for the months ahead to strengthen our programs and impact. Were so grateful for the time\, care\, and creativity each of you brings to this work. Your leadership helps create opportunities\, community\, and connection for our students. This month\, well focus on developing and running a mentorship program designed to help students build meaningful relationships\, navigate college life\, and thrive. Thank you for being part of this vision and for helping lift our students higher every step of the way.
