SUMMARY:Money Matters: Smart Budgeting and Credit Essentials with Tiffany Osman
DESCRIPTION:Join us for Money Matters: Smart Budgeting & Credit Essentials\, a practical and informative workshop designed to help you take control of your financial future. Tiffany Osman from Equitable Advisors will share expert insights on how to create a budget that works\, manage credit responsibly\, and build a strong financial foundation. Whether you're just starting to manage your own finances or looking to strengthen your money management skills\, this session will offer valuable tools and strategies to help you achieve your goals. Date: November 13thTime: 12:30 1:30 PMLocation: 101 Jaynes Hall\, Fairmont State University
LOCATION:101 Jaynes Hall\, 1201 Locust Ave\, Fairmont\, WV
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/3391ae56-d796-4328-94b7-45103360700b15cf2a9e-c245-4832-be6b-fb6aef9f19dc.png
