SUMMARY:ASCE WV Section Board Meeting
DESCRIPTION:Join us for the ASCE WV Section Northern Branch Meeting on Tuesday\, November 12\, at Fairmont State University (Engineering Technology Building\, Room 305). The evening will begin with a WV Section Board Meeting at 5:00 PM (virtual option available)\, followed by a social at 5:30 PM\, dinner at 6:00 PM\, and a presentation by Nathaniel Johnson\, a Fairmont State civil engineering student conducting research through the STaR SURE grant. Nathaniels talk\, Cementitious Binders in Ultra-Lightweight High-Performance Concrete\, will highlight innovative developments in concrete mix design. Cost: $20 for professionals | $5 for students
LOCATION:305 ET
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/6593e698-fba4-4a10-8ddb-f91a311c7c3388415f99-777f-44d6-a005-042dce75dc18.png
