SUMMARY:RISE Thanksgiving Dinner
DESCRIPTION:Come celebrate the season with good food and even better company! Join RISE for a cozy Friendsgivinga chance to relax\, share a meal\, and enjoy some quality time with fellow students before the holiday break. Lets give thanks\, make memories\, and eat together. Everyone is welcome at the table! RISE is a student community for those with foster or kinship care experience. Real support. Real connection. You belong here.
LOCATION:215 Turley Center
