SUMMARY:Ugly Sweater Service Project
DESCRIPTION:Join us as we partner with the Marion County Family Resource and Support Network to help prepare for their Winter Celebrations event\, where students come to explore how different cultures and communities celebrate during the winter season. Youll be working behind the scenes to help set up\, organize\, and make sure everything is ready for a joyful week of learning and celebration. It's a great way to give back\, have fun and show off your festive flair! Ugly sweaters encouraged\, kindness required. Cookies\, cocoa\, and other holiday treats will be provided for all our helpful elves! (Need a sweater? No worries\, we'll have you covered.) RISE is a student community for those with foster or kinship care experience. Real support. Real connection. You belong here.
LOCATION:MCFRN
