SUMMARY:Celebration of Lights: Walker Night
DESCRIPTION:Take a break from finals with RISE! We'll take a relaxing 1.3-mile stroll together among the lovely\, twinkling holiday lights at Morris Park. We'll meet up at Prichard Hall and then shuttle over to Morris Park for the walk! Afterward\, we'll warm up in the lounge with cocoa and cookies! celebrationoflightswv.com RISE is a student community for those with foster or kinship care experience. Real support. Real connection. You belong here.
