UID:11930822@fairmontstate.edu
DTSTAMP:20260803T173206Z
DTSTART:20251212T164500Z
DTEND:20251212T211500Z
SUMMARY:RISE Holiday Party!!
DESCRIPTION:Get ready to celebrate the season with your RISE Fam! We are celebrating the start of holiday festivities and the end of the semester by getting some Mexican for dinner and going axe throwing! We'll meet up at Prichard at 12:00pm and head to Mi Pueblo in Fairmont for a group dinner. Afterward\, we'll head to LumberjAxe for an afternoon of axe throwing! Moments like this are the perfect mix of celebration and connection\, and the holiday season tends to sparkle a little brighter when shared. So let's share an afternoon together before going home for the holidays! RISE is a student community for those with foster or kinship care experience. Real support. Real connection. You belong here.
LOCATION:Prichard Hall
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/9900b41b-4378-4944-be67-e01d5a2598bd9f8227dc-6b24-4c63-ac22-7d48bffa7d00.png
END:VEVENT
