SUMMARY:"Falcons Beyond the Classroom" Spring Podcast Series! Featuring Natalie Feltz of Pierpont Community & Technical College and Mix'n Mamas!
DESCRIPTION:We are excited to welcome Ms. Natalie Feltz to the Falcons Beyond the Podcast! Join us to discuss culinary leadership\, industry impact\, and entrepreneurship\, highlighting program innovation\, statewide influence\, and building a successful mobile bar business. Join via the link below or watch later on the Career Services webpage or listen on Spotify! https://teams.microsoft.com/l/meetup-join/19%3ameeting_OGNmZDRiMzUtYzJkMS00ZDA3LWEyMDItZTg4ODg1NGFkZTEz%40thread.v2/0?context=%7b%22Tid%22%3a%222022711a-5528-497e-ae0a-ab4a4fdcb2b8%22%2c%22Oid%22%3a%22fe9ae2e8-61c0-4647-a022-f2145307713b%22%7d
