SUMMARY:"Falcons Beyond the Classroom" Spring Podcast Series! Featuring Dr. Manil Maskey of NASA!
DESCRIPTION:We are excited to welcome Dr. Manil Maskey to the Falcons Beyond the Classroom Podcast! Join us to discuss data science leadership\, AI innovation\, and cross-agency collaboration\, highlighting NASA modernization efforts\, large-scale data systems and cloud initiatives\, and national leadership in artificial intelligence and research partnerships. Join live using the link below\, watch later via the Career Services webpage\, or listen later on Spotify! https://teams.microsoft.com/l/meetup-join/19%3ameeting_OGNmZDRiMzUtYzJkMS00ZDA3LWEyMDItZTg4ODg1NGFkZTEz%40thread.v2/0?context=%7b%22Tid%22%3a%222022711a-5528-497e-ae0a-ab4a4fdcb2b8%22%2c%22Oid%22%3a%22fe9ae2e8-61c0-4647-a022-f2145307713b%22%7d
