DTEND:20260213T170000Z
SUMMARY:Broken Hearts\, Sweet Starts
DESCRIPTION:Valentines Day got you feeling meh? Weve got you covered!Come to Broken Hearts\, Sweet Starts for a chill\, feel-good event featuring stuffed animals and broken-heart cookies. No pressure\, no romancejust comfort\, community\, and something sweet to snack on!!
LOCATION:Turley Center Ballroom
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/f60627e2-6c19-403b-9bd0-2da74a217510afaa56f0-18bd-4778-a0fb-9f971c2a6f7b.png
