DTSTART:20260217T160000Z
DTEND:20260217T180000Z
SUMMARY:Fat Tuesday on Main Street
DESCRIPTION:Join us for Mardi Gras beads\, delicious cupcakes\, and a fun\, laid-back hangout with fellow students. Whether youre stopping by between classes or staying to socialize\, this is the perfect way to enjoy the day!
LOCATION:Main Street Table 4
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/458dc946-376a-4fb7-8252-724ec71ac8bcfcaab53c-e486-497b-8bd3-39a47be91419.png
