DTSTART:20260305T000000Z
DTEND:20260305T020000Z
SUMMARY:Midterm Cool-Down
DESCRIPTION:Midterms got you feeling overwhelmed? Take a break at Midterm Cool-Down! Cool down with an ice cream bar and unwind with board games alongside fellow students. No studying requiredjust scoops\, games\, and a chance to relax before getting back to it.
LOCATION:2nd Floor Falcon Center
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/fc3314f2-1114-4c89-9687-fff1fcde7329a646fa9d-11c9-4f32-9409-da60918c71d7.png
