DTEND:20260317T230000Z
SUMMARY:St. Patrick's Day Trivia Night
DESCRIPTION:Feeling lucky? Stop by our St. Patricks Day Trivia Night for fun questions\, green mocktails\, and a great way to unwind with friends. No trivia expertise requiredjust show up\, sip something green\, and enjoy the fun.
LOCATION:Turley 106
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/e60e644e-09da-4b94-8e1b-4577e218408f8bce405c-adcd-47bb-998e-87810e2e41a8.png
