DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the end of the semester the Falcon way\, with comfort food and friends! Join us for our semester-endingChicken & Waffles Night! Take a break from studying\, grab a plate\, and enjoy a sweet and savory tradition that's the perfect way to start closing out the semester!
