BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:11961727@fairmontstate.edu
DTSTAMP:20260803T173206Z
DTSTART:20260413T210000Z
DTEND:20260413T230000Z
SUMMARY:Loom Weaving Class
DESCRIPTION:Interested in trying out weaving? In this introductory class\, you will learn to weave on a tabletop rigid heddle loom! With a pre-wound warp\, you will be able to just sit down and weave - no prior experience required. In this one hour class\, participants will weave a set of mug rugs (5x5 each). Most people can complete at least two mug rugs in the class\, but for those who really get into the weaving\, you will be welcome to weave up to 6. This is a class for beginners who have never woven before or for experienced weavers interested in trying out the basics of rigid heddle weaving! Class size is limited to 6 people. Ages 5+. Pre-registration is required\, please follow this link:https://forms.cloud.microsoft/pages/responsepage.aspx?id=GnEiIChVfkmuCqtKT9yyuI8Os3ODWExBhai-mYOiDrtUMThJSFI1UlM5T0pNSUpNQkpDUkQ0N1hRMC4u&route=shorturl
LOCATION:The Frank and Jane Gabor West Virginia Folklife Center\, 1201 Locust Ave.\, Fairmont\, WV
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/e4074ca2-0954-4945-a458-d521c13c2aed6888253d-2e53-4b27-98c6-87824ccf7df4.png
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:11961760@fairmontstate.edu
DTSTAMP:20260803T173206Z
DTSTART:20260304T230000Z
DTEND:20260305T000000Z
SUMMARY:Media Literacy in a Polarized Age
DESCRIPTION:In an era defined by rapid information sharing\, algorithm-driven content\, and increasing political polarization\, distinguishing credible news from misinformation has become an essential civic skill. Join Dr.Laura Harbert\, Assistant Professor of English and Faculty Advisor for the Columns\, for an engaging and accessible talk on media literacy and navigating todays complex news environment.
LOCATION:Falcon Center 301\, Falcon Center\, Fairmont\, WV
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/8698488c-6d0f-42a8-845e-17141f57dda9d79bdf5b-b85d-4203-8c27-c684080eb62f.png
STATUS:CANCELLED
END:VEVENT
