UID:11976104@fairmontstate.edu
DTSTAMP:20260803T173206Z
DTSTART:20260301T210000Z
DTEND:20260301T230000Z
SUMMARY:JC Penney's Suit-Up Event
DESCRIPTION:The JCPenney Suit-Up event is a collaborative partnership between the Fairmont State University Career Development Center and the WVU Career Development Center. This event provides Fairmont State University students with an exclusive additional discounttypically 30%on professional attire\, including suits\, shirts\, shoes\, and accessories. The event is designed to help students build affordable\, professional wardrobes for interviews\, career fairs\, and other career-related opportunities\, often featuring in-store styling assistance and online coupon codes. The Spring Suit-Up Event will take place on Sunday\, March 1\, 2026\, from 4:006:00 p.m. at Morgantown Mall (9500 Mall Rd.\, Morgantown\, WV 26501). This one-day event prepares students with the resources and confidence they need to prepare for future career success.
LOCATION:JCPenney's\, Morgantown Mall  9500 Mall Rd\, Morgantown\, WV
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/d2986aca-4725-470d-bdb9-4def0d09433e5ce82a0b-e92e-40b9-aaf4-2b72e4c1099d.pdf
END:VEVENT
