SUMMARY:Get ahead on homework with RA Harrison!
DESCRIPTION:Students will have the opportunely to take on the semester's workload with great momentum\, accompanied by Ra Harrison! Homework can feel daunting coming back after the winter break\, so this program is designed to provide a safe space to get ahead on academic success\, connecting students with a positive role model and the ability to have company during what could be a tough transition.
