DTSTAMP:20260803T173206Z
DTSTART:20260128T230000Z
DTEND:20260129T010000Z
SUMMARY:Perler Bead Creations with ARD Marley
DESCRIPTION:Spend time with friends and ARD Marley to create Perler Bead Art! ARD Marley will provide the beads\, boards\, and templates to go off of. Residents can request custom templates\, like sprites from Minecraft or Stardew Valley. ARD Marley will help residents tape their creation and poke holes for each of the beads. ARD Marley will iron the beads for the residents. Residents can also create earrings or keychains\, using provided materials.
LOCATION:University Terrace North Lobby
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/c4f30263-b94d-4df5-a8be-11e39cb2e7e7a7b718e7-8657-4194-97cd-6b9ff22908f0.png
