SUMMARY:Building Basic Bracelets with RA Amber
DESCRIPTION:Have a fun night with RA Amber and make your own bracelets to start your semester out strong! Jump into the semester and meet new people and create new friendships. You have more in common with others around you than you think. All Supplies will be provided all you need to do is show up!
LOCATION:Pence Hall Main 1st Floor Lobby
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/d6c62263-dc5e-45b2-a2a5-68d7f4719f3e21895e64-0872-4574-a1f6-15b34098766e.png
