SUMMARY:Games with the Bro's with RA Gavin 
DESCRIPTION:Join us in Bryant place's gaming room (room 604) for a fun and relaxing evening with our community. We will have monitors for whatever game you would like to play as well as a switch to play with other people. You can have your own competitions with a relaxing evening. Free pizza and drinks will be provided.
