SUMMARY:Bracelet Making for the Culture with RA Mike
DESCRIPTION:Join RA Mike on the 6th floor lobby of Bryant Place to create a bracelet that resonates with you. RA Mike will guide you through the process of bracelet making so you can create a bracelet that represents YOU.
