SUMMARY:RA Landon's Miniature Pool Tournament
DESCRIPTION:Join RA Landon for a miniature pool (Billiard) tournament and face off for the grand prize of snacks and a secret jackpot! All rules of standard pool apply to the miniature table and set. Bring friends and have fun!
LOCATION:Pence Hall 1st Lobby
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/f3759881-b539-456e-814a-e8a416b264af20b14e8e-8b4c-4a4b-9a84-e29a71e078e9.png
