SUMMARY:Lunch and Learn: From Zero to OER Hero: A Beginner's Guide to Open Educational Resources
DESCRIPTION:This introductory session demystifies Open Educational Resources (OER) for educators who are new to the concept. Participants will journey from having little or no knowledge of OER to feeling confident about finding\, evaluating\, and implementing free\, high-quality educational materials in their teaching practice. Location:Falcon Center Conference Room 301 Date: January 20\, 2026 Time: 12:20pm-1:20pm
LOCATION:Falcon Center Conference Room 301
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/b224e4e9-0228-45f6-810c-32fb1c6c91758a3dba19-db6c-42a2-a749-6286304d081e.png
END:VEVENT
