SUMMARY:A Falcon Homecoming:  Celebrating Our Years With Dr. G.H. “Budd” Sapp
DESCRIPTION:A Falcon Homecoming:Celebrating Our Years WithDr. G.H. Budd Sapp Dr. G. H. Budd Sapp\, Fairmont State alumnus and emeritus professor in the School of Education\, retired in 2020 after morethan two decades of distinguished service to Fairmont State & the greater Marion County community. Guests are warmly invited to join the the Fairmont State Alumni Association for this celebration of Dr. Sapps dedication\, leadership\, and lasting impact. Guests can purchase tickets to this event by visiting www.fsufoundation.org/falcon-homecoming Guests have until February 19\, 2026 to purchase their ticket.
LOCATION:Fairmont State University\, Falcon Center -Gym 1  1201 Locust Avenue\, Fairmont\, WV
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/107217b3-94c8-496c-b3f2-64a760f990b7ff18b63a-2cb2-435a-b641-833f628921f6.png
