SUMMARY:Vision Board Lite 2026: A Fresh Start with RA Alice
DESCRIPTION:Vision Board Lite is a low-pressure\, creative program designed to help residents reflect on their goals and intentions for the spring semester. Participants will create a simple vision board or written goal sheet focusing on academic\, personal\, and wellness goals. This program encourages self-reflection\, motivation\, and a positive mindset as residents transition into the new semester. Residents may choose to draw\, write\, or list goalsno artistic experience is required. The program is designed to be relaxed and flexible\, allowing residents to participate at their own pace.
