SUMMARY:Spread the Love: Valentine Card Station with RA Alice
DESCRIPTION:Spread the Love is a casual card-making station where residents can create Valentines cards for friends\, roommates\, family members\, or themselves. The program promotes kindness\, gratitude\, and community connection during the Valentines season. Residents can write supportive messages\, appreciation notes\, or affirmations in a relaxed and welcoming environment.
