DTSTAMP:20260803T173206Z
DTSTART:20260420T210000Z
DTEND:20260420T220000Z
SUMMARY:Mending Workshop
DESCRIPTION:In this workshop\, scholar Sherry Harper-McCombs (http://www.sherryharpermccombs.com) will show historical examples from our archives of very hidden and clever mending\, and compare that to modern mending\, which tends to be more visible and almost decorative. She will demonstrate some of the stitches used\, as well as weaving for darning. Participants will make a sampler where they will put together stitches to create sashiko style mending. Registration is required! Follow this link:https://forms.office.com/pages/responsepage.aspx... The Folklife Center has an elevator. Folks needing accommodation\, close parking\, etc.\, please call 304-367-4403.
LOCATION:The Frank and Jane Gabor West Virginia Folklife Center\, 1201 Locust Ave.\, Fairmont\, WV
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/310350a8-990a-4e9a-843f-059831d59e191548fd5a-0f52-4fe3-8bd9-763e2eb0f275.png
END:VEVENT
