SUMMARY:Lunch and Learn: Day in the Life of: Lindsay Morris
DESCRIPTION:Abstract: Have you ever wondered to yourself: Who is Lindsay Morris? Why is Lindsay Morris? HOW is Lindsay Morris? Me too. This series\, "The Day in the Life of: ______\," aims to help us learn a little more about the daily work-life of our colleagues. Ideally\, this Lunch & Learn series helps us better understand the scope of our colleagues positions\, and we begin to see how we can support one another through better referrals and communication on campus. Location: Falcon Center Conference Room 301 Time: 12:20 PM-1:20 PM Presenter: Lindsay Morris
