SUMMARY:Fairmont State University Theater Community Day Trip to NYC
DESCRIPTION:We are excited to extend the invitation for our first Fairmont State University Theater Community Day Trip to NYC! Please see details and booking link below! Booking deadline is February 1st! The plans are to depart from Fairmont on March 6th in the evening and return on the morning of March 8th. Anyone needing to pay a $50 deposit which secures their seat rather then the full amount at the time of booking would need to call 304-906-1181 to be added to the reservations. The balance by the deadline which is 45 days prior to the day of the tour. They can book directly through the website or by calling 304-906-1181 to be added to the reservations. Booking link- https://www.almostheaventours.com/.../summer-nyc-getaway...
