BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:12093790@fairmontstate.edu
DTSTAMP:20260803T173206Z
DTSTART:20260217T223000Z
DTEND:20260218T000000Z
SUMMARY:RISE Mentor Mixer
DESCRIPTION:Are you interested in connecting with a mentor this semester? A mentor is someone you can meet with regularly to talk through things like your academic progress\, emotional well-being\, and personal goals. Together\, you and your mentor decide what works best for both of youwhether thats a weekly check-in\, a phone call\, or a casual coffee meetup. To kick things off\, were hosting a relaxed mentor mixer featuring mocktails and a paint-and-sip activity in a fun\, speed-datingstyle format. This is a low-pressure\, non-judgmental space to get to know one another\, let loose\, and enjoy the evening with no expectations attached. There is no obligation to commit to a mentorthis event is simply an opportunity to connect\, be creative\, and have fun. Come as you are and enjoy the experience. RISE is a student community for those with foster or kinship care experience. Real support. Real connection. You belong here.
LOCATION:301 Falcon Center Conference Room
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/d2e6f885-9c63-4a86-9d2c-4062b06f304b70e81be8-89c9-4ffd-975a-d7f58ff1f0ba.png
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:12093834@fairmontstate.edu
DTSTAMP:20260803T173206Z
DTSTART:20260203T213000Z
DTEND:20260203T223000Z
SUMMARY:RISE Student Org Meeting
DESCRIPTION:Welcome back\, RISE Fam! We are finishing out the first month of 2026 with a RISE Student Org Meeting\, where we will catch up and discuss the events we have planned for Spring 2026 and beyond. Plan to stay later if you want to join our Mentor Mixer\, where you will get the opportunity to apply for a mentor this semester! RISE is a student community for those with foster or kinship care experience. Real support. Real connection. You belong here.
LOCATION:217 Turley Center
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/518b84e9-83c3-4162-8c39-4f97b505af7b6c0fc42b-b6da-43f0-9405-270f5efa334a.png
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:12093959@fairmontstate.edu
DTSTAMP:20260803T173206Z
DTSTART:20260619T233000Z
DTEND:20260620T020000Z
SUMMARY:Fairmont State Town and Gown Players Present: Come From Away 
DESCRIPTION:Come From Awayis based on the true story of the time when the isolated community of Gander\, Newfoundland\, played host to the world. What started as an average day in a small town turned into an international sleepover\, when 38 planes\, carrying thousands of people from around the globe\, were diverted to Ganders airstrip on September 11\, 2001. Undaunted by culture clashes and language barriers\, the people of Gander cheered the stranded travelers with music\, an open bar and the recognition that were all part of a global family.
LOCATION:Wallman Hall Theater\, 1201 Locust Ave. Wallman Hall\, Fairmont\, WV
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/6121673b-6621-4923-b126-bea56ffda9717d38a982-e195-4319-ab9f-d18298ed0388.png
END:VEVENT
