SUMMARY:RISE Winter Workshop: Cooking
DESCRIPTION:Join RISE for a hands-on cooking workshop designed to bring people together through good food and good company. This workshop is all about learning practical cooking skills\, exploring simple recipes\, and building confidence in the kitchenno experience required. In the cooking workshop\, youll learn go-to kitchen skills like how to roast a whole chicken\, cook eggs five different ways\, and put together easy\, impressive party plattersperfect for feeding yourself\, hosting friends\, or surviving life after finals! RISE is a student community for those with foster or kinship care experience. Real support. Real connection. You belong here.
LOCATION:Wesley House
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/175162b0-752e-4a10-af6f-96f4aae9f9b5080eac43-949c-4b1d-bb20-47044e12b610.png
