DTEND:20260303T230000Z
SUMMARY:RISE Winter Workshop: Baking
DESCRIPTION:Join RISE for a cozy\, hands-on baking workshop\, where we will learn the basics of baking cakes and rolls in a fun\, low-pressure environmentno experience required. Well walk through simple techniques\, share tips and tricks\, and enjoy the process of creating something delicious from scratch. Whether you love baking\, want to try something new\, or just need a relaxing break\, this workshop is for you. Come ready to learn\, get a little messy\, and leave with new skills and sweet treats. RISE is a student community for those with foster or kinship care experience. Real support. Real connection. You belong here.
LOCATION:Wesley House
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/3996101f-0176-4eec-9100-df09e4387b0640493e22-3724-44fc-80d4-a8915fc4f46c.png
