DTEND:20260211T000000Z
SUMMARY:RISE Community Dinner
DESCRIPTION:Our RISE Community Dinner is a chance to slow down\, share a meal\, and connect with the people who make our community feel like home. Join us for an evening of good food\, meaningful conversation\, and relaxed togetherness as we gather around the table to unwind and recharge. Whether youre new to RISE or a familiar face\, this dinner is about showing up as you are\, building connections\, and enjoying a warm\, judgment-free space. Come hungry\, bring a friend\, and leave feeling a little more grounded and a lot more connected. RISE is a student community for those with foster or kinship care experience. Real support. Real connection. You belong here.
LOCATION:215 Turley Center
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/e10f6737-204a-4fda-9f75-ca3d30fd7fd94486f3b9-2cc0-4692-b05a-14dcb93210b3.png
