UID:12101634@fairmontstate.edu
DTSTAMP:20260803T173206Z
DTSTART:20260206T170000Z
DTEND:20260206T180000Z
SUMMARY:ACUE Deliberative Dialgoue Training
DESCRIPTION:The Civics Institute and the Center for Teaching and Learning Innovation (CTLI) are pleased to announce a new professional development opportunity designed to support faculty and staff collaboration around the ACUE Deliberative Dialogue courses. This initiative creates a structured\, collegial space for participants to engage with ACUE content while building shared capacity for deliberative dialogue across campus. Beginning Friday\, February 6\, participants are invited to join a weekly luncheon series held in the cafeteria. The series will meet for seven consecutive Fridays (excluding Spring Break)\, from noon to approximately 1:00 p.m.\, with the flexibility to depart as schedules require. By attending at least five sessions\, participants should be able to complete the full ACUE Deliberative Dialogue course series. Sessions six and seven are offered as make-up opportunities\, and participants may also complete coursework independently if needed. Each session provides dedicated time to work through ACUE Deliberative Dialogue modules\, structured conversation and peer support focused on application and practice\, and opportunities for cross-campus collaboration between faculty and staff. Lunch is provided for all participants through distributed lunch tickets. On session days\, a representative from the Civics Institute or CTLI will be available between 11:50 a.m. and 12:10 p.m. to provide lunch tickets. Participants should bring a charged laptop to each session. This luncheon series is intended to reduce barriers to completing ACUE coursework while fostering meaningful dialogue about teaching\, learning\, and civic engagement across the institution. Faculty and staff are encouraged to RSVP in advance to ensure adequate lunch availability.
LOCATION:Falcon Center 3rd Floor - Cafeteria
URL:https://static.campuslabsengage.com/discovery/images/events/learning.jpg
END:VEVENT
