SUMMARY:Color & Calm: A Creative De-Stress Night with ARD Molly
DESCRIPTION:Color & Calm is a relaxed\, low-pressure program designed to help residents unwind\, connect\, and practice self-care through creative expression. Residents will be provided with a variety of coloring pages\, colored pencils\, markers\, and crayons\, and are encouraged to color at their own pace while enjoying a calm\, welcoming environment. Soft music and light conversation will help foster a sense of community while promoting stress reduction and mindfulness. Open to all skill levels\, no artistic experience required. Will be hosted on the 6th floor of Bryant Place!
LOCATION:Bryant Place
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/5758ff28-3aed-40ce-ac13-9f0ca8e7fc41fd8a5555-49bf-44fc-92e0-74b9e7145c7d.png
