SUMMARY:Bite Size Affirmations
DESCRIPTION:Join Student Success for Bite Size Affirmations. Create affirmations and decorate hearts that celebrate you! Enjoy cupcakes\, cookies\, and pink lemonade while you reflect\, create\, and connect. Sweet treats\, positive vibes.
LOCATION:Turley Center\, 1201 Locust Ave Turley 3rd Floor\, Fairmont\, WV
