DTEND:20260203T230000Z
SUMMARY:Mason Jar Lanterns With (ARD Molly)
DESCRIPTION:Join ARD Mollyfor a fun and creative craft activity where residents will make theirown personalized mason jar lanterns from start to finish. During this hands-on session\, residents will decorate their jars using a variety of materials\, including interior dcor accents and painted designs to create a beautiful\, glowing effect.Each lantern will be finished with asafe\, realistic fake candle light\, allowing residents to enjoy the warm ambiance without worry. With guidance and encouragement from ARD Molly\, participants can express their creativity and design a lantern that reflects their own style. This relaxing and enjoyable activity is perfect for all skill levels and offers residents a wonderful keepsake to display in their room or give as a thoughtful gift. This is also located on the 5th floor Lobby of Bryant Place all are welcome.
LOCATION:Bryant Place
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/2bd9f6b2-4a66-4aab-bed7-a391f64fffc8f631dc2a-7a11-421a-b19a-b4c42e343b7b.png
