SUMMARY:RISE Meeting: ELECTIONS
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a RISE Meeting as we discuss current and upcoming events and vote for your RISE leaders! For the first time ever\, our RISE community will hold its inaugural leadership election\, giving you a voice in shaping what comes next. RISE is a student community for those with foster or kinship care experience. Real support. Real connection. You belong here.
