SUMMARY:STEM Workforce Roundtable
DESCRIPTION:Join Industry leaders for our continuation of STEM Collaboration! Fairmont State UniversitysGraduate Studies\, College of Science and Technology\, andEncova Career Development Centerare pleased to invite you to participate in our2nd STEM Workforce Roundtable\, scheduled forMonday\, April 13\, 2026 at 12:00 p.m. to 2:00 p.m.in theFalcon Center Conference Room (3rd Floor). We greatly appreciate the valuable insights and collaboration provided by faculty and employers during ourinitial meeting on April 15\, 2025. Your contributions helpedset the groundworkfor aligning academic programs with workforce needs across our STEM disciplines. As we reconvene\, our goal is tocontinue that progressexpanding discussions oncurriculum alignment\, work-based learning\, and micro-credentialing opportunities. Together\, we can identify practical strategies to strengthen the regional talent pipeline and prepare students for the evolving demands of todays workforce. Key Discussion Topics: Integrating employer feedback into STEM curriculum development Expanding internship\, co-op\, and apprenticeship opportunities Identifying micro-credentials and certifications valued by industry Strengthening early student engagement and career readiness initiatives Exploring new technologies and skills shaping the future workforce Your continued partnership and expertise are vital to this initiative\, and we look forward to your participation in shaping the next phase of collaboration betweeneducation and industry. PleaseRSVP by Monday\, April 6\, 2026to confirm your attendance. If you have any questions or wish to suggest additional discussion topics\, feel free to contact us directly. Lunch will be provided. Warm regards\,Dr. Mary Sortino\, Chair-Graduate Studies Dr. Deb Hemler\, Interim Dean\, College of Science and Technology Ms. Susan Rodriguez\, Senior Director of Career Services
LOCATION:Falcon Center 3rd Floor Conference Rooms\, 1201 Locust Ave\, Fairmont\, WV
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/5085b76f-c294-4372-9da0-0f4d8ac2acb99befad86-de70-4e95-b051-2b39f1791e20.png
END:VEVENT
