UID:12153282@fairmontstate.edu
DTSTAMP:20260803T173206Z
DTSTART:20260228T180000Z
DTEND:20260228T230000Z
SUMMARY:Basketball & Cheer Alumni Day
DESCRIPTION:Please make plans to attend the Fairmont State Mens and Womens basketball games on Saturday\, February 28\, at Joe Retton Arena\, as the Fighting Falcons take on Frostburg State University\, and we celebrate our Basketball & Cheer Alumni! 1 p.m. - Basketball and Cheer AlumniReception-second floor of the Feaster Center (behind the bleachers) for all basketball and cheer alumni 2 p.m. - Women's Game- former Womens Basketball players will be recognized on the court at halftime Following Women's Game - Basketball and Cheer AlumniReception- second floor of the Feaster Center (behind the bleachers) for all basketballalumni 4 p.m. - Men's Game-former Mens Basketball players and Cheer alumni will be recognized on the court at halftime Basketball and Cheer alumni should complete the online registration form by Friday\, February 20. For more information\, contact Jenna Livers\,Assistant Athletic Director of External Affairs & Resource Development:Jenna.Livers@fairmontstate.edu
LOCATION:Jo Retton Arena\, Feaster Center\, 1201 Locust Avenue\, Fairmont\, WV
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/f11139e1-fa65-4cb9-bc56-6136c26a9c1d40b94da6-9060-4c15-9f1e-3fbfa0a81e98.png
