DTSTART:20260421T210000Z
DTEND:20260421T223000Z
SUMMARY:RISE Meeting
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a RISE meeting focused on connection\, collaboration\, and growth. Well share updates\, discuss upcoming initiatives\, and create space for thoughtful conversation and community building. This meeting is a chance to stay informed\, contribute ideas\, and strengthen the RISE community together. RISE is a student community for those with foster or kinship care experience. Real support. Real connection. You belong here.
LOCATION:217 Turley Center
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/d92abc5f-36f1-4f76-a35e-6724b4e2895eed447667-7bf6-427e-b048-5d30f120f72f.png
