BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:12210440@fairmontstate.edu
DTSTAMP:20260803T173206Z
DTSTART:20260316T150000Z
DTEND:20260316T170000Z
SUMMARY:Secretary of State Mobile Office Hours
DESCRIPTION:Join us at the Falcon Center for Mobile Office Hours with the West Virginia Secretary of States Office\, a convenient\, on-campus opportunity to connect directly with state officials. Representatives will be available to assist with voter registration and election-related questions\, business registration and filings\, notary services\, and other resources provided by the Secretary of States Office. This drop-in event is open to students\, faculty\, staff\, and community members and is designed to make essential state services more accessible while encouraging civic engagement.
LOCATION:Main Street\, Falcon Center
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/654246fa-d6ea-465d-b0a8-e261f376bf7f5ae9691c-d466-425f-b0fa-69095191a54a.png
END:VEVENT
