DTSTART:20260428T213000Z
DTEND:20260429T003000Z
SUMMARY:RISE Community Dinner + Painting the Bell
DESCRIPTION:Our RISE Community Dinner is a chance to slow down\, share a meal\, and connect with the people who make our community feel like home. Join us for an evening of good food\, meaningful conversation\, and relaxed togetherness as we gather around the table to unwind and recharge. Dress appropriately because after our Community Dinner\, we will be PAINTING THE BELL in honor of Foster Care Awareness Month! RISE is a student community for those with foster or kinship care experience. Real support. Real connection. You belong here.
LOCATION:Turley 215
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/fb28610a-79d6-4ae8-9b4a-42244403e7d66267db1e-799c-42ec-b4e8-467e6987cb40.png
