SUMMARY:Self love letters with RA Caitlyn 
DESCRIPTION:February is the month of love so why not focus on more than just a relationship? During this event\, everyone will be writing love letters to themselves with all the amazing things about you!! Second semester can be rough\, especially with this weather\, so why not come down and create a cute card to yourself full of all the best things about you! You can put anything you love about yourself in these like your sports\, your academics\, your hair styles\, your hobbies\, your personality\, anything you want! Feel free to bring a friend too\, you can have them include some of the things they love about you too!! Hope to see you there!
