SUMMARY:Falcon Success Lounge - Ink It\, Think It! 
DESCRIPTION:Taking notes isnt about writing everything downits about knowing what to write down. At this Ink It\, Think It Falcon Success Lounge\, youll learn how to use the Cornell Note-Taking Method and active listening skills to capture the most important ideas in class and turn them into useful study tools. Well show you how to stay engaged\, organize your notes\, and study smarter instead of harder. Walk away with a system you can use in every class to boost understanding\, confidence\, and grades.
