SUMMARY:Opening Reception for AA+D Faculty Exhibition 
DESCRIPTION:Fairmont State Universitys Department of Architecture\, Art\, and Design invites the campus and community to the opening reception of the 2026 Architecture\, Art\, & Design Faculty Exhibition at the John David Brooks Gallery. This annual exhibition showcases recent work by current faculty across the departments visual art programs\, offering a rare opportunity to experience the creative research\, professional practice\, and diverse methodologies that shape instruction in Architecture\, Studio Art\, Graphic Design\, and related disciplines. The exhibition highlights the depth and range of faculty scholarship while reinforcing the departments commitment to creative inquiry\, innovation\, and real-world application.
LOCATION:John David Brooks Gallery - Wallman Hall\, 1201 Locust Ave\, Fairmont\, WV
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/840b172c-7c37-426d-88a6-3edc5c5f492e2764775f-ebeb-40cd-899a-046f73d8b089.png
END:VEVENT
