SUMMARY:CAWV Scholarship Visit
DESCRIPTION:Mr. Pat McDonald and Mr. Jason Hunter will be on campus discussing the Contractors Association of West Virginia Scholarship Program.The CAWV Scholarship Foundation offers scholarships to sophomores\, juniors\, and seniors enrolled in civil engineering or a construction-related four-year degree program in a West Virginia college or university.West Virginia residents attending out-of-state schools offering a construction-related curriculum not available in West Virginia are also eligible. The top award is in the amount of $8\,000. Additional awards of varying amounts are awarded to other applicants chosen by the Scholarship Foundation.https://www.cawv.org/scholarship/
LOCATION:ET 102
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/f35b119c-3635-4410-9045-bbe7bc36f42691d90444-7115-41b0-9bdd-cae9a10b8463.png
END:VEVENT
