DTSTAMP:20260803T173206Z
DTSTART:20260321T160000Z
DTEND:20260321T203000Z
SUMMARY:Soft Girl Era -Beauty Con 
DESCRIPTION:The women of Zeta Phi Beta would like to host a "Soft Girl Era" Beauty CON in one of the conference rooms as a way to create a safe space for students and local marion county women who want to explore more options with their hair and beauty techniques that can help to elevate simple styling into a complete and elegant look. We would like to rent a conference room or use a space that has access to the internet and would allow us to set up the makeup take home pack for participants to actively participate in the make-up /glam portion of the event with our model. We would like the date of this hosting to be February 21stSaturday from 1 until 3. Thank you for your time and consideration of this event
LOCATION:Falcon Center Conference Rooms
URL:https://static.campuslabsengage.com/discovery/images/events/cultural.jpg
END:VEVENT
