SUMMARY:Campus-Wide Easter Egg Hunt
DESCRIPTION:Get ready for an egg-citing day on campus! Delight Ministries is hosting a campus-wide Easter Egg Hunt on April 6\, 2026\, from 8:00 AM to 4:00 PMor until all eggs have been found and you wont want to miss it! Hidden all across campus\, youll find colorful eggs filled with prizes\, surprises\, and chances to win awesome Fairmont State University swag\, gift cards\, and more. Keep your eyes open all day long because one lucky student who discovers the Golden Egg will win the grand prize! Grab your friends\, explore campus\, and join the fun for a full day of adventure\, community\, and celebration. Who will find the golden egg? It could be you!
LOCATION:Fairmont State University\, 1201 Locust Ave 1201 Locust Ave\, Fairmont\, WV
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/fdd64e54-5272-41a2-9d80-c468ad4b853bd54144cf-be66-4a5a-80ad-e5b04952f206.png
