SUMMARY:Dirty Soda Bar: Chill Before the Thrill
DESCRIPTION:Take a break\, mix up something fun\, and ease into midterms with us at the Falcon Success Lounge! Join our Dirty Soda Bar: Chill Before the Thrill for a laid-back hour of creativity\, conversation\, and community. Build your own customized soda with a variety of flavors\, creams\, and mix-insthen stick around to unwind\, connect with other students\, and casually chat about the upcoming midterm season. Whether you want to swap study tips\, share whats stressing you out\, or just enjoy a refreshing drink and a mental reset\, this is your space to relax before the academic push. No pressurejust good vibes\, good drinks\, and good company. Location: Falcon Success Lounge (1st Floor Library) Date: Tuesday\, March 3rd Time: 3:004:00 PM Come sip\, de-stress\, and get in the right mindset to tackle midterms with confidence.
LOCATION:Ruth Ann Musick Library -1st Floor\, 1201 Locust Ave Fairmont\, WV 26554\, Fairmont\, WV
