DTSTART:20260306T143000Z
DTEND:20260306T160000Z
SUMMARY:Refresher with Refreshments- Navigate360 Proactive Campaigns: Plan It and Launch It
DESCRIPTION:Please join us in-person or via Zoom. Link: https://eab.zoom.us/j/97231792392?from=addon This working session will focus on designing and launching proactive outreach in Navigate360. Well align on audience and goals\, build a campaign together\, and set up automated messages and nudges. By the end\, your campaign will be scheduled and ready to go. Why should you join\, you ask? Navigate is an incredible tool to use for many reasons. Currently\, Fairmont State has been using it mostly for appointment management and there's so much more we can do. You can create targeted and timed communications with filtered student populations. You can see when and where the most student interactions happen during the day through the Navigate360 heat maps. You can see what and how your campus partners are communicating to students.
LOCATION:Falcon Center Conference Room 301\, 1201 Locust Avenue\, Fairmont\, West Virginia
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/27950741-a3d5-492e-ad4d-7a64ac62b5e2b5f63589-4028-447e-8453-d7a64b30d276.png
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:12281743@fairmontstate.edu
DTSTAMP:20260803T173206Z
DTSTART:20260429T130000Z
DTEND:20260429T190000Z
SUMMARY:Celebration of Student Scholarship
DESCRIPTION:The Celebration of Student Scholarship (CoSS) is an annual academic event that highlights the research\, creative works\, and scholarly achievements of Fairmont State University students. Established to support the institutions commitment to academic excellence\, CoSS provides an opportunity for students to present their work to faculty\, peers\, and the campus community. The event has become a distinguished platform for showcasing the depth of innovation and intellectual engagement across disciplines.
LOCATION:Falcon Center Conference Rooms\, 1201 Locust Ave.\, Fairmont\, WV
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/98e103b1-1a3b-4730-ad55-ed0658feb72f25a44f9e-f520-4788-b6fd-6c7abdfba61e.png
END:VEVENT
