DTSTAMP:20260803T173206Z
DTSTART:20260226T120000Z
DTEND:20260226T123000Z
SUMMARY:Good Morning\, Falcons!
DESCRIPTION:Start your day the bright way with a Good Morning Americastyle celebration designed just for our students! As a fun companion to Good Morning Fairmont\, this cheerful morning gathering is all about connection\, positivity\, and kicking off the day together. Enjoy a light breakfast with delicious donuts\, bagels\, and hot coffee while you mingle\, laugh\, and share some morning energy with friends. We cant wait to see you there lets make it a great morning\, Falcons!
LOCATION:Gym 1 (Entire Gym)
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/c0c672e7-f7b5-43a3-a4e7-2ce27a4823dfd20f3879-e7eb-4283-acde-55f8070bc38d.png
