DTEND:20260303T190000Z
SUMMARY:Piece & Chill
DESCRIPTION:Need a break from midterm prep? Step away from the notes and join us for a fun puzzle session! Work together\, meet new people\, and give your brain a different kind of challenge before diving back into exams.
LOCATION:Bryant Place 5th Floor Lounge\, 1120 Bryant St\, Fairmont\, West Virginia
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/c7f48483-c446-4f9f-9346-74c02ac1e6ac822f9899-fc2a-4eda-8677-0e7da1442991.pdf
