BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:12289751@fairmontstate.edu
DTSTAMP:20260803T173206Z
DTSTART:20260323T133000Z
DTEND:20260323T151500Z
SUMMARY:Refresher with Refreshments- Navigate360 AI & Automation
DESCRIPTION:This is the second "Refresher" of Navigate360. Please join us in-person or via Zoom. Link: https://eab.zoom.us/j/97231792392?from=addon Description: Join us for a hands-on session focused on using AI and automation in Navigate360 to reduce manual work. Well show AI tools for drafting messages\, pulling insights\, and building reports\, then set up simple automations together\, including alerts\, campaign triggers\, and scheduled reports. Youll leave with at least one automation live and running. Why should you join\, you ask? Navigate is an incredible tool to use beyond appointment management. You can create targeted and timed communications with filtered student populations. You can see when and where the most student interactions happen during the day through the Navigate360 heat maps. You can see what and how your campus partners are communicating to students.
LOCATION:Falcon Center Conference Room 301\, 1201 Locust Avenue\, Fairmont\, WV
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/62e54243-4469-4873-ad7c-a393dca2ee6f6c3088fb-0800-4d40-8090-abe57fa079e9.png
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:12291381@fairmontstate.edu
DTSTAMP:20260803T173206Z
DTSTART:20260322T160000Z
