SUMMARY:Wartz-N-All
DESCRIPTION:Wartz-n-All Jam! Goes from 10:00 a.m. to 3:00 p.m.\, with a break from 12 p.m. to 1:00 p.m. Bring your instrument and be prepared for an unstructured day of musical fun and friendship. Got a question about some technique or tune? Someone will give you an answer. Take the elevator upstairs after signing in at the door\, or if you want to see some beautiful artworks\, take the stairs. Wait! Dont have a dulcimer? Maybe youve thought about one. We will be having some cardboard dulcimers available and some basic\, beginners instruction. So come one\, come all. Come to play\; come to listen\; come to learn\; but especially\, come to have fun!
LOCATION:The Frank and Jane Gabor West Virginia Folklife Center\, 1201 Locust Ave.\, Fairmont\, WV
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/7ee69ebe-bea5-4550-b755-2639576903be44ba4e1c-9176-4f30-88fd-4af347b64797.png
