DESCRIPTION:Visit us on Mainstreet at the Falcon Center on April 15th from 11AM-1PM. Grab a rock and write a positive message going into finals! We will leave them around campus to spread positive vibes for finals week! Also\, participation in this event\, enters you a chance to win a session with Zen Jen and her access bars!Access Bars is a gentle\, energy-based therapy that involves lightly touching 32 points on your head. The bars are connected to different areas of your life and can hold onto limiting thoughts and emotions. Zen Jen will be coming to campus April 20-24th.
