SUMMARY:Positive Note Board
DESCRIPTION:Positive Note Board is a simple community-building program where residents are invited to write encouraging messages\, compliments\, or kind notes for others on their floor. Residents can leave general messages such as motivational quotes\, supportive reminders\, or positive words that anyone in the community can read. Participants will write their messages on sticky notes and place them on a shared board labeled with a positive theme Kind Words Wall. The activity creates a welcoming environment and encourages kindness and positivity within the residence hall community.
LOCATION:University Terrace North Lobby
