SUMMARY:College Tour Premiere
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an in-person premiere at Fairmont State University! Join us onApril 18 at 3:00for the debut of our episode ofThe College Touron Amazon Prime. Experience Fairmont State through real student stories\, unforgettable moments\, and an authentic look at campus lifecelebrated together as a campus community.
