SUMMARY:YEE HAW SEE Y'All
DESCRIPTION:Yeehaw See Yall is one of the biggest and most exciting events on campus. A high-energy\, country-themed evening packed with fun. Enjoy free food and drinks while jumping into interactive activities\, friendly competition\, and nonstop entertainment. Take on the rock wall\, test your skills on the mechanical bull and axe throwing\, race through the obstacle course\, and join in on line dancing\, all with so much more to experience throughout the night. With something going on everywhere you look\, its the perfect chance to relax\, have fun\, and make memories with friends. Grab your boots and come be part of one of Fairmont States favorite traditions!
