SUMMARY:West Virginia Harvest Day
DESCRIPTION:Elior Collegiate Dining will be hosting West Virginia Harvest Day on Tuesday\, April 14\, 2026\, from 11:00 AM 2:00 PM. This lunch will showcase locally sourced ingredients from West Virginia farmers\, including farm-fresh products provided by West Virginia Harvest. The event highlights the importance of supporting local agriculture and allows our campus community to experience seasonal foods grown and produced within the state. Dishes prepared for lunch will emphasize fresh\, regional flavors and provide an opportunity to connect with the bounty of West Virginias farms.
LOCATION:Dining Hall
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/daf4ac10-2d40-431a-8af7-08de516a3689e687d0b7-ce38-41a2-987e-f31ad8368d29.pdf
