SUMMARY:(ARD Molly) Donuts and Gratitude Night
DESCRIPTION:Take a break\, grab a donut\, and recharge your mindset. Join ARD Molly for Donuts & Gratitude Night. This relaxed\, low-pressure event is all about slowing down and focusing on the positives. Students are invited to write down three things theyre grateful for\, big or small\, and reflect on whats going well in their lives. For those who feel comfortable\, there will be an optional opportunity to share with the group. With a calm\, welcoming atmosphere and plenty of sweet treats\, this event is designed to support mental well-being\, reduce stress\, and help build a sense of community. Come as you are\, enjoy some donuts\, and leave feeling a little lighter.
LOCATION:Bryant Place 6th Floor
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/f697757b-3fea-4ffd-a5e9-6ffbbd84106b3862bb9c-384d-4269-8bb4-81107ef4c898.png
