SUMMARY:Falcon Success Lounge
DESCRIPTION:Brain Break Lounge: Step Away\, Reset\, Come Back Strong Finals coming up? Your brains probably working overtime.Take a break that actually helps you recharge. Stop by the lounge for a hands-on reset with Legos\, magnetic tiles\, and space to just unplug for a bit. Build something\, zone out\, laugh with friends\; whatever helps you hit pause. Need a quick academic boost before heading back to study? The Student Success team will be there to help with last-minute questions\, study tips\, or anything you need to feel more prepared. Come for a few minutes or stay awhile\, your brain will thank you.
LOCATION:Ruth Ann Musick Library - 2nd floor\, 1201 Locust Ave\, Fairmont\, WV
