DTSTART:20260414T190000Z
DTEND:20260414T200000Z
SUMMARY:Falcon Success Lounge
DESCRIPTION:Motivation Station: Refuel Before Finals Running on empty? Youre not alone\, and you dont have to push through it solo. Stop by the lounge for a quick reset designed to help you finish the semester strong without burning yourself out. Build your own motivation jar filled with quotes\, reminders\, and a few laughs youll actually want to keep. Take what you need for the final stretch. Well also share a few simple\, realistic study strategies (like the Pomodoro technique) that can help you stay focused when your brain is ready to tap out. No pressure. No long commitment. Just a chance to recharge\, refocus\, and leave with something that helps you keep going.
LOCATION:Ruth Ann Musick Library - 2nd floor\, 1201 Locust Ave\, Fairmont\, WV
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/ca9dc979-8494-4002-8a47-c3e4dd57b8aaec644ef0-3597-40a4-9249-b0aca45eda58.png
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:12414031@fairmontstate.edu
DTSTAMP:20260803T173206Z
DTSTART:20260421T190000Z
DTEND:20260421T200000Z
SUMMARY:Falcon Success Lounge
DESCRIPTION:Mad Libs Lounge: Your Semester\, Your Story This semester at Fairmont State University was full of moments: some funny\, some unexpected\, and some youll definitely never forget. Stop by the lounge and turn your experiences into creative\, laugh-out-loud Mad Libs. Whether its a class moment\, a campus memory\, or something completely random\, youll bring it to life in a way thats fun\, light\, and uniquely yours. Its a chance to take a break\, connect with others\, and look back on the semester with a little humor (and maybe a little pride\, too). Come for a few minutes or stay awhile\; either way\, youll leave with a story worth sharing.
LOCATION:Ruth Ann Musick Library - 2nd floor\, 1201 Locust Ave\, Fairmont\, WV
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/8d798dba-d39d-4fa9-a6c3-07fbe79c54bc8d1685a7-88ea-4c46-b9d1-3dbd9a64e1d2.png
