SUMMARY:Find Your Joy in the Library
DESCRIPTION:For Library Week 2026 (April 19-25)\, we're inviting you to findJoy in your library and win big! Throughout Library Week\, we will be posting daily Instagram clues so you can track down Joy (from Inside Out fame) somewhere in the library. When you find Joy: Bring Joy to the service desk Claim a piece of candyand a sticker Submit your name to our raffle drawing You can find Joy once per day for up to 5 chances to win! Grand Prize:A fun summer-themed prize basket stocked with goodies from the SOAR Store. Joy could be anywhere in the library\, so... Follow our Instagram @musicklibrary because clues will drop there daily! See you in the library April 19-25!
