DESCRIPTION:Join us for our final American Institute of Architecture Students meeting of the academic year! During this meeting\, well be holding board nominations for the upcoming yearthis is a great opportunity to get involved\, take on a leadership role\, and help shape the future of our chapter. Well also be celebrating the end of the semester with a taco bar\, so come hungry and ready to connect with fellow members. Whether youre interested in running for a position or just want to enjoy some good food and company\, wed love to see you there!
