DTEND:20260420T170000Z
SUMMARY:Build Your Own Self Care Kit
DESCRIPTION:Finals are coming\, take a moment to take care of you. Stop by and pick up a DIY self-care kit designed to help you relax\, recharge\, and stay focused during finals week. Each kit includes a variety of stress-relief goodies like fidget toys\, calming face masks\, and other thoughtful items to support your well-being. Whether you need a quick mental break or a way to unwind after studying\, these kits are here to help you manage stress and feel your best. Supplies are limited\, so dont miss out\, grab yours and give yourself the care you deserve during this busy time!
LOCATION:Main Street Table 4
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/90559af0-ffcd-418b-a77a-61f88f2b197b16e1cfde-428d-4a2f-80ef-2bc60862047b.png
