SUMMARY:Lunch & Learn: ISSO Presents the COBA Industry Panel
DESCRIPTION:After Dogs with the Dean\, join us for a great opportunity to discuss with former or current industry partners about how their time at Fairmont State University has helped to shape their career. Learn from industry professionals and alumni as they share real-world experiences\, career paths\, and tips for success in business\, information systems\, data analytics\, and cybersecurity management.
