DTEND:20260920T220000Z
SUMMARY:JC Penney Suit Up Event
DESCRIPTION:Get ready to dress for success at the JC Penney Suit Up Event! Join us at the Morgantown Mall on September 20 from 4:00 PM to 6:00 PM for an exclusive shopping experience designed just for students.Take advantage of steep discounts on professional attire\, accessories\, shoes\, and even scrubsperfect for interviews\, internships\, and career fairs. Students in attendance will be entered to win a $50 gift card to JC Penney\, making your savings even better! The savings dont stop thereclearance items also qualify for additional discounts\, helping you build a polished wardrobe without breaking the bank. Dont miss this opportunity to upgrade your professional look and step confidently into your future!
LOCATION:JC Penney - Morgantown Mall\, 9500 Mall Road\, Morgantown\, WV
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/26b887db-8265-47df-a954-06e9916b241be35a9ba7-d9f2-4a4f-accf-0392933890f2.png
