DTSTART:20270331T140000Z
DTEND:20270331T173000Z
SUMMARY:All Majors Spring Career Fair
DESCRIPTION:2027 All Majors Spring Career Fair Students and alumni are invited to join us on March 31\, 2027\, from 10:00 AM 1:30 PM in Falcon Center Gyms 1 & 2! Connect with employers\, explore career opportunities\, and take the next step toward your future. Dress professionally to make a strong first impression! The first 250 students will receive a FREE tote bag with a professional padfolio. Dont miss this opportunity to invest in your career!
LOCATION:Falcon Center Gyms 1 & 2\, 1201 Locust Ave 1201 Locust Ave\, Fairmont\, WV
URL:https://static.campuslabsengage.com/discovery/images/events/learning.jpg
END:VEVENT
