UID:12454214@fairmontstate.edu
DTSTAMP:20260803T173206Z
DTSTART:20260504T190000Z
DTEND:20260504T213000Z
SUMMARY:Star Wars Day at the Library
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate May the 4th with a much-needed study break at the Library! Were bringing a little galaxy far\, far away right to the College on the Hill. Join us for a lineup of Star Warsthemed activities\, including Pin the Lightsaber on Yoda\, where your aim (and maybe your connection to the Force) will be put to the test. Step into some friendly competition with inflatable lightsaber battles. Then\, battle your fellow Jedi (or Sith) in Star Wars Trivia! Whether youre a lifelong fan or just looking for a fun break\, we invite you to relax\, connect with friends\, and power through finals with a bit of intergalactic energy. May the Fourth be with you through finals week!
LOCATION:Ruth Ann Musick Library
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/697d2ed8-3015-41ea-b27b-7cf061ce39da7354cee3-e882-439a-b97b-4acda8ffe8d7.png
