DTEND:20260825T233000Z
SUMMARY:RISE Community Dinner
DESCRIPTION:Our RISE Community Dinner is a chance to slow down\, share a meal\, and connect with the people who make our community feel like home. Join us for an evening of good food\, meaningful conversation\, and relaxed togetherness as we gather around the table to unwind\, recharge\, and enjoy. Can't stay? That's okay! Grab a plate to go! Our community members provide fresh\, homecooked meals at each Community Dinner. Able to stay a while? Bring a friend! All are welcome here. RISE is a student community for those with foster or kinship care experience.Real support. Real connection. You belong here.
LOCATION:Turley 215
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/b39051ef-c20f-4da9-9724-ffe6bcdf1f93d6fdb7b3-2a0d-40d4-a923-35ec76f4a55d.png
