SUMMARY:Disagreement Forum 
DESCRIPTION:A live forum where two scholars take opposite sides of a real issue\, make their strongest case\, and then do something radical: actually listen to each other. Principled Disagreement is about modeling the kind of intellectual discourse that is increasingly rare\, showing students that you can fight hard for an idea without losing your civility or your curiosity.
LOCATION:MMA\, 1201 Locust Avenue\, Fairmont\, WV
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/bb2daba2-88e2-4836-83e7-2af5c4cab295b731b1fb-27b1-48e3-ae36-375223abb6da.png
