SUMMARY:Business & Industry Day
DESCRIPTION:Business & Industry Day connects BSBA 2800 students with various top industry leaders for a unique\, hands-on professional development experience through: - Resume Review - Interview Tips - Mock Interviews November 12\, 2026 Session 1 - 11:00am - 12:15pm Session 2 - 1:30pm - 2:45pm
LOCATION:Falcon Center Conference Rooms\, 1201 Locust Avenue\, Fairmont\, WV
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/06bee822-dbca-484f-9818-0db2bc0f4b7abcb2c25c-5f90-4096-a873-d8e9db9d0dcf.png
