DTSTART:20260917T220000Z
DTEND:20260918T000000Z
SUMMARY:The Falcon 28 
DESCRIPTION:The Fairmont 28 is a student competition built around one question: if you could add one amendment to the U.S. Constitution\, what would it be? Student teams research\, draft\, and pitch an original proposal to a panel of judges and a live audience\, making the case for why their amendment belongs alongside the Bill of Rights. More information to come.
LOCATION:Falcon Center Conference Room 302
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/2b804306-1c15-44b4-812c-e94645bc6bc2019b899c-3577-4508-bfa1-5c6def4157a3.png
