SUMMARY: Constitution Week Opening Ceremony
DESCRIPTION:Join us as we kick off Constitution Week with a celebration of civic participation and the enduring promise of American democracy! The ceremony will feature a presidential address from President Michael K. Davis. This event is free and open to all students\, faculty\, staff\, and community members. Come ready to reflect on what it means to be an engaged citizen and bring a friend!
LOCATION:Main Street\, 1201 Locust Avenue\, Fairmont\, WV
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/237de414-083a-41c2-ae22-21630a2fa8f5ff2d3983-28d1-483a-8648-f4e21dc59504.png
