DTSTART:20260922T213000Z
DTEND:20260922T233000Z
SUMMARY:Real Talk: Sexual Health\, Safety and Empowerment 
DESCRIPTION:Join Student Health in an engaging Guest Speaker session that will provide accurate\, inclusive\, and practical information about sexual health. Topics will include consent\, contraception\, STI prevention\, healthy relationships and communication skills. The session is aimed to reduce stigma\, promote informed decision-making\, and empower students make safe decisions regarding their health.
LOCATION:Falcon Center Conference Room
