SUMMARY:Turley After Dark
DESCRIPTION:Turley After Dark Fall 2026 Get ready for an unforgettable evening at Turley After Dark! Join us this fall in the Turley Ballroom for a themed night filled with fun\, connection\, and exciting activities designed just for you. This free event is open to all students\, but space may be limited\, so be sure to RSVP when registration opens. Event Highlights May Include: Interactive games and DIY activities Opportunities to connect with Success Coaches Free food and themed refreshments Photo opportunities to capture the memories Hosted by your Success Coaches\, Turley After Dark is the perfect chance to relax\, meet new people\, and enjoy a fun night on campus. Come as you are or dress to match the themewe cant wait to see you there!
LOCATION:Turley Ballroom - 3rd Floor\, 1201 Locust Ave Fairmont\, WV 26554\, Fairmont\, WV
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/ad2403cb-c593-4318-b805-ece5b6fe78f52e5518b6-266c-475b-9bcf-1915bf4f589c.png
