DTSTART:20270211T170000Z
DTEND:20270211T210000Z
SUMMARY:Bite Sized Affirmations
DESCRIPTION:Bite Size Affirmations Take a break and nourish both your mind and mood at Bite Size Affirmationsa relaxed\, feel-good event centered on positivity\, creativity\, and connection. Spend time creating personal affirmations and decorating keepsakes that celebrate you\, while enjoying a cozy\, welcoming atmosphere designed for self-care and community. Whether youre looking for a boost\, a reset\, or just a space to unwind\, this event offers something for everyone. What to Expect: Affirmation-making and creative activities Cozy elements like stuffed animals and comfort-themed crafting Free snacks and sweet treats A supportive\, low-pressure space to relax\, reflect\, and connect No pressure\, no expectationsjust positive vibes\, a sense of comfort\, and something sweet to enjoy.
LOCATION:Turley Ballroom - 3rd Floor\, 1201 Locust Ave Fairmont\, WV 26554\, Fairmont\, WV
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/677a3a0b-714f-4fae-90c6-e10fc06de6c3e063b412-be9b-41d5-8436-32413c6f1723.png
END:VEVENT
