SUMMARY:Datha and Gene Bridge Week
DESCRIPTION:Welcome to Bridge Week! We are so excited to kick off a week filled with connection\, fun\, support\, and new experiences as we welcome our newest first-generation students to campus. This is just the beginning of an amazing year with the Datha and Gene First-Gen Program!
LOCATION:Falcon Center Conference Room 301\, Locust Avenue
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/39c0209c-8c88-4b4a-a562-4114696b2c2724af48d3-a256-4665-87a6-2220858d55f1.png
