DTSTAMP:20260803T173206Z
DTSTART:20260901T220000Z
DTEND:20260901T233000Z
SUMMARY:Presidential Speaker Series: Rajiv Vinnakota
DESCRIPTION:Join us for Presidential Speaker Series\, with speaker Rajiv Vinnakota! Reception to follow.
