SUMMARY:Main Street Major Exploration
DESCRIPTION:Explore your path at Main Street Major Exploration! Stop by for a fun\, interactive experience where you can discover majors\, connect with advisors\, and build your own custom major mix at our candy salad bar. Your journey starts heresee where it takes you!
