UID:12486344@fairmontstate.edu
DTSTAMP:20260803T173206Z
DTSTART:20261022T220000Z
DTEND:20261023T010000Z
SUMMARY:Small Town Universe Film Showing
DESCRIPTION:What and When: Doors open at 6:00 p.m. for a film showing of Small Town Universe at 6:30 p.m.\, followed by a Q&A with filmmaker Katie Dellamaggiore starting at 8:00 p.m. Where: The Ruth Ann Musick Library on Fairmont State University's campus\, library room MMA Synopsis:Small Town Universe paints an intimate and captivating portrait of life in Green Bank\, West Virginia\, home the world's most sensitive radio telescope and the only town in the United States where Wi-Fi and cell phones are banned.
LOCATION:Ruth Ann Musick Library\, 1201 Locuse Ave.\, Fairmont\, WV
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/d577a1ab-1cc8-4e62-ac8b-694b587f4e4c16f46b06-9fc8-4bcd-b3ba-0f3aa3b8aa37.png
END:VEVENT
