DESCRIPTION:Get moving with this high-energy dance fitness class that combines easy-to-follow choreography with upbeat music from around the world. Zumba is a fun and effective way to improve cardiovascular fitness\, burn calories\, and boost your moodall while feeling more like a dance party than a workout. Open to ages 16 and older. Classes are included with Falcon Center membership. Nonmembers are welcome to participate by purchasing a drop-in class pass at the front desk. Bring a water bottle and get your move on!
