DTSTART:20261023T150000Z
DTEND:20261023T190000Z
SUMMARY:The Health Fair
DESCRIPTION:Join us for our annual Health Fair\, a fun and engaging event focused on health\, wellness\, and community resources. Attendees will have the opportunity to connect with local organizations and campus partners\, participate in wellness activities\, receive health information and screenings\, enjoy giveaways\, and learn about services that support a healthier lifestyle. The Health Fair is free and open to students\, employees\, and community members.
LOCATION:Falcon Center - Gym 2\, 1201 Locust Ave Falcon Center - Gym 2\, Fairmont\, West Virginia
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/6a243679-d593-4778-bf9e-7ffdb8c23afa909499b8-8519-49a9-b3b6-baab6d7596a4.png
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:12492264@fairmontstate.edu
DTSTAMP:20260803T173206Z
DTSTART:20260823T180000Z
DTEND:20260823T200000Z
SUMMARY:Folklife Center Awards
DESCRIPTION:The Folklife Center Awards celebrates community members\, scholars\, and organizations who maintain and facilitate regional traditions. This event will feature an awards ceremony and performance from 2:00 p.m. to 3:00 p.m.\, followed by a Square Dance\, clogging\, and interactive mending fun from 3:00 p.m. to 4:00 p.m.! Come to dance\, learn\, and enjoy.
LOCATION:The Frank and Jane Gabor West Virginia Folklife Center\, Squibb Wilson Blvd.\, Fairmont\, WV
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/e3797e5d-3a4b-4088-9cfa-c65dcfd1bdc9db17363e-40e4-47d1-b637-f00dd3489c23.png
END:VEVENT
