DTSTAMP:20260803T173206Z
DTSTART:20260912T110000Z
DTEND:20260912T170000Z
SUMMARY:President Mike's Movie Night: Aladdin
DESCRIPTION:Join us in showing Aladdin\, for President Mike's Movie Night! This event is FREE and open to the public\, there will be FREE popcorn\, cotton candy\, and drinks\, as well as food trucks that can be purchased from. ALSO...Princess Jasmine will be here with us! Come see her and dance with her\, until the movie begins! EVENTS start at 5:30...MOVIE starts at 7:00! See you there!!
LOCATION:Colebank Gym
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/8577deb3-bfa0-498b-a311-7ef928b0270b55b2ddf0-f124-49a3-80c3-b7a9763e6d5a.png
