BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:12493173@fairmontstate.edu
DTSTAMP:20260803T173206Z
DTSTART:20260713T040000Z
DTEND:20260720T040000Z
SUMMARY:StepUp Walking Challenge
DESCRIPTION:Join our StepUp Walking Challenge and take steps to better health\, teamwork\, and a little friendly competition! Staff and Faculty are encouraged to form teams and track their daily steps throughout the challenge. Whether you take a quick stroll during lunch or set out on a hike\, every step counts toward you team's total. The team with the highest step count at the end of the challenge will be eligible for a prize! This is great opportunity to increase physical activity\, support workplace wellness\, and connect with colleagues toward a common goal. In order to participate please download the StepUp App on Apple or Android. A QR code for app information has been included on the flyer. Lace up your shoes\, gather your teams and StepUp to the challenge July 13-20.
LOCATION:Online
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/0f455cb7-d695-4e31-8214-af4e125ba25231a785e7-0df1-407e-a980-fe11b2503170.png
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:12494687@fairmontstate.edu
DTSTAMP:20260803T173206Z
DTSTART:20260829T160000Z
DTEND:20260829T200000Z
SUMMARY:Fairmont vs. Dayton-Falcon Fan Bus
DESCRIPTION:You're invited to hop on the Falcon Fan bus to Dayton\, Ohio\, to cheer on the Fighting Falcons at the University of Dayton! More information will be available soon\, but you can reserve your space now!
LOCATION:University of Dayton
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/1853a865-27cc-4cad-a8a2-223d4023669dd14fe61d-dbf6-4c59-be6a-090ff8f7103e.png
STATUS:CANCELLED
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:12494689@fairmontstate.edu
DTSTAMP:20260803T173206Z
DTSTART:20261001T220000Z
DTEND:20261001T230000Z
SUMMARY:Homecoming Parade
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate one of the most exciting traditions of the year at the Homecoming Parade! Join students\, alumni\, faculty\, staff\, and community members as we come together to showcase Falcon pride with decorated floats\, spirited performances\, campus organizations\, and special guests. Whether you're marching\, cheering from the sidelines\, or reconnecting with fellow Falcons\, the Homecoming Parade is the perfect way to celebrate our campus community and kick off an unforgettable Homecoming weekend.
LOCATION:Everest Drive
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/f58e17bc-8f80-4a8d-9b1c-5e5aa5a0cf40e29419ba-1886-4fc2-b17f-f3e9dd129a20.png
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:12494831@fairmontstate.edu
DTSTAMP:20260803T173206Z
DTSTART:20260720T220000Z
DTEND:20260721T000000Z
SUMMARY:Student Bowling Night 
DESCRIPTION:Join us at the Fairmont Bowling Center 6-8pm for free bowling!
LOCATION:Fairmont Bowling Center\, 1 kirkway Dr
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/e488f170-7b47-4e2b-9846-a1b2232041dd92c5b6a4-cca2-49b6-b9ac-5dc77dc12090.png
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:12494835@fairmontstate.edu
DTSTAMP:20260803T173206Z
DTSTART:20261118T170000Z
DTEND:20261118T190000Z
SUMMARY:DIY Picture Frames
DESCRIPTION:Get creative and capture your favorite memories at our DIY Picture Frame event! Design and decorate your own personalized picture frame using fun materials and creative touches. Whether youre showcasing a favorite photo\, creating a gift for someone special\, or adding a personal touch to your space\, this activity is the perfect way to relax\, express yourself\, and enjoy some hands-on fun with friends.
LOCATION:Main Street
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/1075637c-e8c3-4e0f-a66b-abaa44264f6ed9e10678-5f76-4446-b054-a42c67a11ed9.png
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:12494836@fairmontstate.edu
DTSTAMP:20260803T173206Z
DTSTART:20261210T020000Z
DTEND:20261210T040000Z
SUMMARY:Chicken and Waffles
DESCRIPTION:Satisfy your cravings and enjoy a delicious campus favorite at Chicken & Waffles! Stop by for a tasty meal featuring the perfect combination of crispy\, savory chicken and sweet\, fluffy waffles. Whether youre grabbing a bite with friends or looking for a fun way to break up your day\, this event is the perfect opportunity to enjoy great food and connect with the Falcon community.
LOCATION:Dining Hall
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/fc9b36f8-b709-46c2-a2c3-3cc7765c0b1904a5f184-5e21-4a74-a2f7-1a1241d28ec5.png
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:12494838@fairmontstate.edu
DTSTAMP:20260803T173206Z
DTSTART:20261117T170000Z
DTEND:20261117T190000Z
SUMMARY:Embroidery Kits Giveaway
DESCRIPTION:Unwind\, get creative\, and learn a new skill with our Embroidery Kit Giveaway! Pick up a free embroidery kit and discover the relaxing art of stitching while creating something uniquely yours. Whether youre a beginner or looking to try a new hobby\, embroidery is a fun way to take a break\, reduce stress\, and enjoy a mindful activity during a busy semester.
LOCATION:Main Street
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/8a49b333-01b7-4a59-9369-acc930a2d62c64911eb7-e0b5-4b74-aac4-47d31df4846d.png
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:12494842@fairmontstate.edu
DTSTAMP:20260803T173206Z
DTSTART:20261030T000000Z
DTEND:20261030T030000Z
SUMMARY:Casino Night
DESCRIPTION:Step into a night of excitement\, entertainment\, and friendly competition at Casino Night! Try your luck with casino-style games\, enjoy the vibrant atmosphere\, and spend an unforgettable evening with friends. Whether you're a seasoned player or new to the tables\, everyone is welcome to join in the fun\, win prizes\, and experience the thrill of the casinono experience required!
LOCATION:Colebank Gym
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/4e3b030f-d982-456f-bd4c-1377c6f856319c9f0b8e-74a0-4243-b539-ed532b96220f.png
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:12494847@fairmontstate.edu
DTSTAMP:20260803T173206Z
DTSTART:20261117T223000Z
DTEND:20261118T000000Z
SUMMARY:Antibiotics 101: Safety\, Resistance and Prevention
DESCRIPTION:Join Student Health in an educational discussion about safe antibiotic use and the dangers associated with antibiotic resistance and misuse. This event is to increase awareness and help to individuals make informed medical decisions regarding the need and use of antibiotics.
LOCATION:Falcon Center Conference Room
