DESCRIPTION:Think you have what it takes to be a Falcon Cheerleader? Fairmont State Cheerleading is holding tryouts for the 2026-2027 season! Join a team that supports Falcon Athletics\, performs at campus events\, and will be competing on one of college cheers biggest stages: NCA College Nationals. Were looking for athletes who are committed\, coachable\, and ready to push themselves. Whether youre an experienced cheerleader or have a strong background in gymnastics\, dance\, stunting\, or tumbling\, wed love to see what you can bring to the team. Come be part of a team that works hard\, competes with pride\, and creates memories that last a lifetime. Register today and start your journey as a Fairmont State Cheerleader! Show us what youve got! Contact becky.wilson@fairmontstate.edu for registration and questions!
