DTSTART:20270329T160000Z
DTEND:20270329T220000Z
SUMMARY:Red Cross Blood Drive
DESCRIPTION:Make a difference and help save lives by participating in our Red Cross Blood Drive. Every donation has the potential to help patients in need\, including accident victims\, cancer patients\, and those undergoing life-saving medical treatments. The donation process is safe\, simple\, and only takes a short amount of time\, but the impact can last a lifetime. Join us in supporting our community and giving hope to those who need it most.
LOCATION:Turley 106
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/ca3f4589-f3ab-475b-9c0b-affd2a66136ce11a2983-49e1-40e7-84d8-9f8b95dbeeeb.png
