SUMMARY:Falcon Con
DESCRIPTION:Press play on a day of fun\, connection\, and friendly competition! Whether you enjoy classic board games\, fast-paced party games\, or your favorite video games\, there's something for everyone. Challenge your friends\, discover a new favorite game\, or simply relax and enjoy the company of others. All skill levels are welcome to play\, laugh\, and make great memories together!
LOCATION:Falcon Center Conference Rooms
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/6d6cee38-68f8-48da-a73c-92b974be9123b6cfb4e3-68bc-474f-94b3-043fe22b402a.png
