UID:12503048@fairmontstate.edu
DTSTAMP:20260803T173206Z
DTSTART:20270126T200000Z
DTEND:20270126T220000Z
SUMMARY:Intention Bracelet Making on Main
DESCRIPTION:Create a one-of-a-kind bracelet featuring a word\, phrase\, or date that holds special meaning to you. Choose an intention that reflects what you want to embrace\, remember\, or carry with you such as strength\, hope\, breathe\, believe\, or a meaningful mantra. You'll hand-stamp your chosen message into a metal bracelet\, creating a lasting reminder of your values\, goals\, or personal journey. Wear it every day as a symbol of the intention you've set for yourself.
LOCATION:Main Street
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/e342eba1-0d08-450f-8079-f0fbff5d5668be2bcc6a-9ac6-4d16-9f92-4ff8412dcd7b.png
