DTSTART:20260821T200000Z
DTEND:20260821T220000Z
SUMMARY:Honors Back-to-School Bash
DESCRIPTION:Join the Honors Association for its annual back-to-school bash and help us celebrate the start of a new academic year!
LOCATION:Shaw House (preferred)
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/3aa7d6a6-6a15-47ba-a198-b221ba923b33dc0dd2cc-c581-4356-9a0b-8fe5c8cd218a.png
