BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:12503468@fairmontstate.edu
DTSTAMP:20260803T173206Z
DTSTART:20260713T160000Z
DTEND:20260717T020000Z
SUMMARY:On the Road with Fairmont State University
DESCRIPTION:This July\, Fairmont State University is taking its mission on the road. Led by President Mike Davis\, On the Road with Fairmont State brings University leaders\, students\, faculty\, staff\, and alumni directly into communities across West Virginia to listen\, connect\, and build lasting partnerships. The visit begins with a big kickoff at Twin Falls Resort on July 13\, followed by countywide events\, community tours\, and meaningful conversations with the people and places that make Southern West Virginia special. Fairmont State is committed to being more than a university located in West Virginia. We are a university for West Virginia. This visit is an opportunity to meet with local leaders\, legislators\, municipalities\, schools\, businesses\, community organizations\, alumni\, families\, and residents to better understand the needs\, priorities\, and opportunities in Southern West Virginia. Through these conversations\, Fairmont State hopes to strengthen relationships\, identify meaningful partnerships\, and show how the University can serve as a resource for communities across the state. July 13 Kickoff EventTwin Falls Resort\, Wyoming County July 14 Community Visits\, Meetings & EngagementRaleigh & Wyoming Counties July 15 Community Visits\, Meetings & EngagementMcDowell County July 16 Community Visits\, Meetings & EngagementRaleigh & Wyoming Counties See more in the full schedule details.
LOCATION:Raleigh\, Wyoming\, & McDowell Counties
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/b9ccb75b-f721-449a-9e1e-4db4e711594cd41e4019-9442-41d5-a619-2d6dc0e87f33.png
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:12503469@fairmontstate.edu
DTSTAMP:20260803T173206Z
DTSTART:20260711T200000Z
DTEND:20260712T020000Z
SUMMARY:Falcon Nation: Appalachian Music Festival
DESCRIPTION:Join us for the Appalachian Music Festival on July 11\, 2026. President Davis will be giving a welcome at this event\, and the President's Office will be making FREE sno-cones to hand out! Come enjoy the wonderful music\, spread some Falcon Pride\, and enjoy the big firework show to commence the event!
LOCATION:Middletown Commons\, 9503 Mall Loop\, Whitehall\, WV
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/2a3c05f8-8719-4f50-ab37-3369b3394344cd736929-3bf3-46ab-bf93-666ea0f2f77f.png
