DESCRIPTION:Discover everything our campus has to offer at the Falcon Resource Fair! Connect with student organizations\, explore campus programs\, and learn about the many resources available to support your academic success\, personal growth\, and campus involvement. Whether you're looking to get involved\, find support services\, build leadership skills\, or meet new people\, this is your opportunity to engage with the Falcon community and find your place on campus. Stop by\, ask questions\, and see how you can make the most of your college experience!
