SUMMARY:The Amazing Wellness Race
DESCRIPTION:Think you know what a mental health fair looks like? Think again. The Amazing Wellness Race (TAWR) is not your average race it's a full-on wellness adventure inspired by The Amazing Race\, minus the stress. No Roadblocks. No Speed Bumps. No Eliminations. Just you\, your crew\, and a passport ready to get stamped. Hit up to 8 stations between the Start and Finish Line\, each one designed by wellness experts to challenge you in a different way write a letter that could make someone's whole year\, test your mental health knowledge\, trade your story for a symbol of resilience\, bead a keychain that's so you\, break out of your comfort zone and make a new friend\, and more. Collect a stamp at every station you complete\, turn in your passport at the Finish Line\, and walk away with your official TAWR Completion Certificate plus prizes and plenty of photo ops along the way. No competition. No pressure. Just connection\, self-care\, and a little bit of magic. Come race toward a healthier\, happier you.
LOCATION:Falcon Center 2nd Floor
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/dc7c5cbc-9bf0-42e2-ab06-e817def3145b83c2aa96-a6ff-467a-ad65-5db57f5590db.png
END:VEVENT
