UID:12530911@fairmontstate.edu
DTSTAMP:20260803T173206Z
DTSTART:20260813T130000Z
DTEND:20260813T140000Z
SUMMARY:First Flight Group 25 Check Ins
DESCRIPTION:First Flight Group 25! Find your First Flight Leader in the middle of the Falcon Center Quad (outside)\, You will use the Engage App to check in (take attendance). Your leader will go over with you what's next and walk there as a group. This is a group for off-campus students (i.e. commuters and students who do not live on campus). We know that you may not have a meal plan\, so your leader will have meal tickets for you for the dining hall! You must go to your group check-in to get your meal tickets. You will be provided with a ticket for breakfast and lunch on Thursday 8/13/26\, breakfast on Friday 8/14/26\, and ONE dinner ticket\, to be used the 13\, 14\, 15\, OR 16th. Friday lunch is a campus-wide picnic and you will not need a dining plan nor a meal ticket.
LOCATION:Middle of the Falcon Center Quad (outside)
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/99e7a756-c317-4eb6-9300-f8cdd2f5702ec2a59b3d-94ad-49d1-97f4-feda2af69397.png
STATUS:CANCELLED
END:VEVENT
