DESCRIPTION:First Flight Group 27! Find your First Flight Leader on the Parking Garage Bridge--between Morrow and Jaynes. Youwill use the Engage App to check in (take attendance). Your leader will go over with youwhat'snext and walk there as a group. This is a group for off-campus students (i.e.commuters and students who do not live on campus). We know that you may not have a meal plan\, so your leader will have meal tickets for you for the dining hall! You must go to your group check-in to get your meal tickets. You will be provided with a ticket for breakfast and lunch on Thursday 8/13/26\, breakfast on Friday 8/14/26\, and ONE dinner ticket\, to beusedthe 13\, 14\, 15\, OR 16th. Friday lunch is a campus-widepicnicand you will not need a dining plan nor a meal ticket.
