DESCRIPTION:First Flight Group 33! Find your First Flight Leader between Morrow and Prichard Halls (outside)\, Youwill use the Engage App to check in (take attendance). Your leader will go over with youwhat'snext and walk there as a group. This is a group for off-campus students (i.e. commuters and students who do not live on campus). We know that you may not have a meal plan\, so your leader will have meal tickets for you for the dining hall! You must go to your group check-in to get your meal tickets. You will be provided with a ticket for breakfast and lunch on Thursday 8/13/26\, breakfast on Friday 8/14/26\, and ONE dinner ticket\, to be used the 13\, 14\, 15\, OR 16th. Friday lunch is a campus-wide picnic and you will not need a dining plan nor a meal ticket.
LOCATION:between Morrow and Prichard Halls (outside)
