DESCRIPTION:First Flight Group 36! Find your First Flight Leader in the Falcon Center Quad\, outside the doors to Gym 1. Youwill use the Engage App to check in (take attendance). Your leader will go over with youwhat'snext and walk there as a group. This is a group for off-campus students (i.e.commuters and students who do not live on campus).We know that you may not have a meal plan\, so your leader will have meal tickets for you for the dining hall!You must go to your group check-in to get your meal tickets.You will be provided with a ticket for breakfast and lunch on Thursday 8/13/26\, breakfast on Friday 8/14/26\, and ONE dinner ticket\, to beusedthe 13\, 14\, 15\, OR 16th.Friday lunch is a campus-widepicnicand you will not need a dining plan nor a meal ticket.
LOCATION:Falcon Center Quad\, outside the doors to Gym 1
URL:https://se-images.campuslabs.com/clink/images/62875194-7a61-4a59-8fcf-829519547f5d18e9d31b-29cc-4e8d-a1b1-13b3bfa4c2a3.png
END:VEVENT
